k for dropped loose change.','Uwielbia okrągłe przedmioty. Wędruje nocą po ulicach w poszukiwaniu drobnych.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/base6-53',1.33,0.15,'53'),('base6-54','Metapod',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',70,'Grass',11,'base6','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/54.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/54_hires.png','It is vulnerable to attack because its shell is soft, exposing its weak and tender body.','Jest podatny na ataki, ponieważ jego skorupa jest miękka, odsłaniając jego słabe i delikatne ciało.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/base6-54',1.49,0.1,'54'),('base6-55','Nidorina',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',70,'Grass',30,'base6','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/55.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/55_hires.png','The female\'s horn develops slowly. Prefers physical attacks such as clawing and biting.','Róg samicy rozwija się powoli. Preferuje ataki fizyczne, takie jak drapanie i gryzienie.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/base6-55',0.64,0.1,'55'),('base6-56','Nidorino',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',60,'Grass',33,'base6','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/56.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/56_hires.png','An aggressive Pokémon that is quick to attack. The horn on its head secretes a powerful venom.','Agresywny Pokémon, który szybko atakuje. Róg na jego głowie wydziela potężny jad.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/base6-56',2.31,0.08,'56'),('base6-57','Omanyte',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',40,'Water',138,'base6','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/57.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/base6/57_hires.png','Although long extinct, in rare cases, it can be genetically resurrected from fossils.','Choć wymarły dawno temu, w rzadkich przypadkach można go genetycznie wskrzesić ze skamieniałości.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardma