n the weather turns cold, lots of Ledyba gather from everywhere to cluster and keep each other warm.','Kiedy pogoda robi się zimna, mnóstwo Ledybów zjeżdża się zewsząd, by się ogrzać.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/hgss1-71',0.18,0.02,'71'),('hgss1-72','Magikarp',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Water',129,'hgss1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/72.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/72_hires.png','For no reason, it jumps and splashes about, making it easy for predators like Pidgeotto to catch it mid-jump.','Bez powodu skacze i pluska, co ułatwia drapieżnikom takim jak Pidgeotto złapanie go w trakcie skoku.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/hgss1-72',0.34,0.02,'72'),('hgss1-73','Mareep',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Lightning',179,'hgss1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/73.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/73_hires.png','If static electricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you.','Jeśli w jego ciele gromadzi się elektryczność statyczna, jego runo podwaja swoją objętość. Dotknięcie go może spowodować porażenie prądem.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/hgss1-73',0.2,0.02,'73'),('hgss1-74','Marill',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',183,'hgss1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/74.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/74_hires.png','The end of its tail serves as a buoy that keeps it from drowning, even in a vicious current.','Koniec ogona służy jako boja, która chroni przed utonięciem, nawet w silnym nurcie.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/hgss1-74',0.16,0.02,'74'),('hgss1-75','Meowth',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Colorless',52,'hgss1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/75.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/hgss1/75_hires.png','It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and secretly hoards.',