olenia na pokolenie.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-41',0.26,0.1,'41'),('sm1-42','Primarina-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,GX','Stage 2',250,'Water',730,'sm1','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/42.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/42_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-42',2.14,0.89,'42'),('sm1-43','Crabominable',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Water',740,'sm1','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/43.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/43_hires.png','It just throws punches indiscriminately. In times of desperation, it can lop off its own pincers and fire them like rockets.','Po prostu bezmyślnie zadaje ciosy. W chwilach desperacji może odciąć sobie szczypce i wystrzelić je jak rakiety.','Metal',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-43',0.21,0.02,'43'),('sm1-44','Wishiwashi',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Water',746,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/44.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/44_hires.png','When it\'s in trouble, its eyes moisten and begin to shine. The shining light attracts its comrades, and they stand together against their enemies.','Kiedy ma kłopoty, jego oczy wilgotnieją i zaczynają świecić. Świecące światło przyciąga jego towarzyszy i stają razem przeciwko swoim wrogom.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-44',0.08,0.02,'44'),('sm1-45','Dewpider',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',751,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/45.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/45_hires.png','It crawls onto the land in search of food. Its water bubble allows it to breathe and protects its soft head.','Wpełza na ląd w poszukiwaniu pożywienia. Jego bańka wodna pozwala mu oddychać i chroni jego miękką głowę.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-45',0.07,0.02,'45'),('sm1-46','Araquanid',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Water',752,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/46.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/46_hires.png','It delivers headbutts with the water bubble on its head. Small Pokémon get sucked into the bubble, where they drown.','Zadaje uderzenia głową bańką wodną na głowie. Małe Pokémony zostają wciągnięte do bańki, gdzie toną.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-46',0.12,0.02,'46'),('sm1-47','Pyukumuku',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',771,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/47.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/47_hires.png','It lives in shallow seas, such as areas near a beach. It can eject its internal organs, which it uses to engulf its prey or battle enemies.','Żyje w płytkich morzach, takich jak obszary w pobliżu plaży. Może wyrzucać swoje narządy wewnętrzne, których używa do pochłaniania ofiary lub walki z wrogami.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-47',0.12,0.02,'47'),('sm1-48','Bruxish',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Water',779,'sm1','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/48.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/48_hires.png','It stuns its prey with psychokinesis and then grinds them to mush with its strong teeth. Even Shellder\'s shell is no match for it.','Ogłusza swoją ofiarę psychokinezą, a następnie rozgniata ją na miazgę swoimi mocnymi zębami. Nawet skorupa Shelldera nie jest dla niego żadnym wyzwaniem.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-48',0.14,0.02,'48'),('sm1-49','Chinchou',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',170,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/49.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/49_hires.png','It lives in the depths beyond the reach of sunlight. It flashes lights on its antennae to communicate with others of its kind.','Żyje w głębinach poza zasięgiem światła słonecznego. Błyska światłami na swoich antenach, aby komunikować się z innymi osobnikami swojego gatunku.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,