łupać duże drzewo. Jego największym rywalem w Alola jest Vikavolt.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-6',0.09,0.02,'6'),('sm1-60','Hypno',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Psychic',97,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/60_hires.png','As a matter of course, it makes anyone it meets fall asleep and has a taste of their dreams. Anyone having a good dream, it carries off.','Jako rzecz oczywistą sprawia, że ​​każdy, kogo spotka, zasypia i ma przedsmak swoich snów. Każdego, kto ma dobry sen, zabiera.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-60',0.09,0.02,'60'),('sm1-61','Espeon-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,GX','Stage 1',200,'Psychic',196,'sm1','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/61_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-61',4.15,0.7,'61'),('sm1-62','Mareanie',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Psychic',747,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/62.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/62_hires.png','It plunges the poison spike on its head into its prey. When the prey has weakened, Mareanie deals the finishing blow with its 10 tentacles.','Wbija trujący kolec na głowie w ofiarę. Kiedy ofiara osłabnie, Mareanie zadaje ostateczny cios swoimi 10 mackami.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-62',0.05,0.02,'62'),('sm1-63','Toxapex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Psychic',748,'sm1','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/63.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/63_hires.png','Toxapex crawls along the ocean floor on its 12 legs. It leaves a trail of Corsola bits scattered in its wake.','Toxapex pełza po dnie oceanu na swoich 12 nogach. Pozostawia za sobą ślad z rozrzuconych kawałków Corsola.','Psychic',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-63',0.28,0.05,'63'),('sm1-64','Cosmog',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Psychic',789,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/64.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/64_hires.png','Its body is gaseous and frail. It slowly grows as it collects dust from the atmosphere.','Jego ciało jest gazowe i kruche. Powoli rośnie, zbierając pył z atmosfery.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-64',0.06,0.02,'64'),('sm1-65','Cosmoem',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',790,'sm1','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/65.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/65_hires.png','Motionless as if dead, its body is faintly warm to the touch. In the distant past, it was called the cocoon of the stars.','Nieruchome, jakby martwe, jego ciało jest lekko ciepłe w dotyku. W odległej przeszłości nazywano je kokonem gwiazd.','Psychic',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-65',0.21,0.02,'65'),('sm1-66','Lunala-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,GX','Stage 2',250,'Psychic',792,'sm1','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/66.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/66_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-66',0.5,2.09,'66'),('sm1-67','Makuhita',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Fighting',296,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/67.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/67_hires.png','It was originally brought in from another region, but now Makuhita from Alola are more famous.','Pierwotnie przywieziono je z innego regionu, ale teraz sławniejsze są Makuhita z Alola.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-67',0.05,0.02,'67'),('sm1-68','Hariyama',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Fighting',297,'sm1','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/68.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/68_hires.png','It is known for its fantastic strength, but as it grows older, it focuses more on training Makuhita.','Jest znany ze swojej fantastycznej siły, ale im jest starszy, tym bardziej skupia się na szkoleniu Makuhity.','Psychic',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-68',0.18,0.02,'68'),('sm1-69','Roggenrola',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fighting',524,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/69.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/69_hires.png','The hexagonal cavity is its ear. It walks in the direction of sounds it hears, but if the sounds cease, it panics and topples over.','Jego sześciokątna wnęka to ucho. Idzie w kierunku dźwięków, które słyszy, ale jeśli dźwięki ustają, wpada w panikę i przewraca się.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-69',0.07,0.02,'69'),('sm1-7','Surskit',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Grass',283,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/7.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/7_hires.png','When this Pokémon senses danger, a sweet fluid oozes from the tip of its heads. The taste of it disgusts bird Pokémon.','Kiedy ten Pokémon wyczuwa niebezpieczeństwo, z czubków jego głów wycieka słodki płyn. Jego smak obrzydza Pokémony ptaków.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-7',0.05,0.02,'7'),('sm1-70','Boldore',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Fighting',525,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/70.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/70_hires.png','It explores caves in search of underground water. It\'s not comfortable around water, so this Pokémon takes great care in lapping it up.','Eksploruje jaskinie w poszukiwaniu podziemnej wody. Nie czuje się komfortowo w pobliżu wody, więc ten Pokémon bardzo uważa, żeby ją wylizać.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-70',0.08,0.02,'70'),('sm1-71','Gigalith',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Fighting',526,'sm1','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/71.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/71_hires.png','Known for its hefty horsepower, this Pokémon is a popular partner for construction workers.','Znany ze swojej dużej mocy, ten Pokémon jest popularnym partnerem pracowników budowlanych.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-71',0.47,0.02,'71'),('sm1-72','Crabrawler',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Fighting',739,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/72.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/72_hires.png','It punches so much, its pincers often come off from overuse, but they grow back quickly. What little meat they contain is rich and delicious.','Uderza tak mocno, że jego szczypce często odpadają od nadmiernego używania, ale szybko odrastają. Ta odrobina mięsa, którą zawierają, jest bogata i pyszna.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-72',0.08,0.02,'72'),('sm1-73','Passimian',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Fighting',766,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/73.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/73_hires.png','They form groups of roughly 20 individuals. Their mutual bond is remarkable—they will never let down a comrade.','Tworzą grupy liczące około 20 osób. Ich wzajemna więź jest niezwykła — nigdy nie zawiodą towarzysza.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-73',0.08,0.02,'73'),('sm1-74','Sandygast',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Fighting',769,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/74.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/74_hires.png','It takes control of anyone who puts a hand in its mouth. And so it adds to the accumulation of its sand-mound body.','Przejmuje kontrolę nad każdym, kto włoży rękę do jego pyska. I tak przyczynia się do gromadzenia się jego ciała przypominającego kopiec piasku.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-74',0.05,0.02,'74'),('sm1-75','Palossand',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Fighting',770,'sm1','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/75.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/75_hires.png','Buried beneath the castle are masses of dried-up bones from those whose vitality it has drained.','Pod zamkiem znajdują się masy wysuszonych kości tych, których siły witalne zostały przez niego wyssane.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-75',0.09,0.02,'75'),('sm1-76','Alolan Rattata',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Darkness',19,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/76.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/76_hires.png','When the sun goes down, it becomes active. It runs around town on a chase for good food for the boss of its nest—Raticate.','Kiedy słońce zachodzi, staje się aktywny. Biega po mieście w pogoni za dobrym jedzeniem dla szefa swojego gniazda — Raticate\'a.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-76',0.08,0.02,'76'),('sm1-77','Alolan Raticate',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Darkness',20,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/77.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/77_hires.png','This gourmet Pokémon is particular about the taste and freshness of its food. Restaurants where Raticate live have a good reputation.','Ten Pokémon smakosz jest wybredny w kwestii smaku i świeżości swojego jedzenia. Restauracje, w których mieszka Raticate, mają dobrą reputację.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-77',0.11,0.02,'77'),('sm1-78','Alolan Meowth',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Darkness',52,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/78.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/78_hires.png','This Pokémon was not originally found in Alola. Human actions caused a surge in their numbers, and they went feral. They\'re prideful and crafty.','Ten Pokémon pierwotnie nie został znaleziony w Alola. Działania człowieka spowodowały wzrost ich liczebności i zdziczały. Są dumne i przebiegłe.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-78',0.11,0.02,'78'),('sm1-79','Alolan Persian',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Darkness',53,'sm1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/79.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/79_hires.png','Its round face and smooth coat—softer than the most high-class velvet—have made this a very popular Pokémon in Alola.','Jego okrągła twarz i gładka sierść — bardziej miękka niż najdroższy aksamit — sprawiły, że jest to bardzo popularny Pokémon w Alola.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-79',0.21,0.02,'79'),('sm1-8','Masquerain',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Grass',284,'sm1','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/8.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/8_hires.png','Its wings and antennae don\'t cope well with moisture. After a rain, it faces sunward to dry off.','Jego skrzydła i czułki nie radzą sobie dobrze z wilgocią. Po deszczu ustawia się twarzą ku słońcu, aby wyschnąć.','Fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-8',0.15,0.02,'8'),('sm1-80','Umbreon-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,GX','Stage 1',200,'Darkness',197,'sm1','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/80.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/80_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-80',9.58,1.49,'80'),('sm1-81','Carvanha',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Darkness',318,'sm1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/81.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/81_hires.png','If they scent the faintest trace of blood, they rush to attack en masse. When alone, they\'re rather cowardly.','Jeśli wyczują choćby najmniejszy ślad krwi, rzucają się do ataku masowo. Kiedy są sami, są raczej tchórzliwi.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm1-81',0.09,0.02,'81'),('sm1-82','Sharpedo',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Darkness',319,'sm1','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/82.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm1/82_hires.png','It has a sad history. In the past, its dorsal fin was a treasured foodstuff, so this Pokémon became a victim of overfishing.','Ma smutną historię. W przeszłości jego płetwa grzbietowa była cenionym poż