e Salandit it has attracted with its pheromones to serve it.','Salazzle żyje głęboko w jaskiniach i zmusza Salanditów, których przyciągnął swoimi feromonami, do służenia mu.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-34',0.09,0.02,'34'),('sm11-35','Slowpoke & Psyduck-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,TAG TEAM,GX','Basic',250,'Water',54,'sm11','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/35.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/35_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-35',37.56,7,'35'),('sm11-36','Lapras',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Water',131,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/36.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/36_hires.png','It likes swimming around with people on its back. In the Alola region, it\'s an important means of transportation over water.','Lubi pływać z ludźmi na grzbiecie. W regionie Alola jest ważnym środkiem transportu wodnego.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-36',0.26,0.02,'36'),('sm11-37','Snorunt',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Water',361,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/37.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/37_hires.png','It feeds mainly on ice and snow. It\'s only able to survive in a limited number of places in the warm Alola region.','Żywi się głównie lodem i śniegiem. Jest w stanie przetrwać tylko w ograniczonej liczbie miejsc w ciepłym regionie Alola.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-37',0.08,0.02,'37'),('sm11-38','Froslass',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Water',478,'sm11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/38.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/38_hires.png','It freezes hikers who have come to climb snowy mountains and carries them back to its home. It only goes after men it thinks are handsome.','Zamraża wędrowców, którzy przybyli, aby wspiąć się na ośnieżone góry i niesie ich z powrotem do swojego domu. Poluje tylko na mężczyzn, których uważa za przystojnych.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-38',0.72,0.1,'38'),('sm11-39','Finneon',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Water',456,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/39.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/39_hires.png','When night falls, their pink patterns begin to shine. They\'re popular with divers, so there are resorts that feed them to keep them close.','Kiedy zapada noc, ich różowe wzory zaczynają świecić. Są popularne wśród nurków, więc istnieją ośrodki, które je karmią, aby mieć je blisko siebie.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-39',0.09,0.02,'39'),('sm11-4','Celebi',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Grass',251,'sm11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/4.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/4_hires.png','This Pokémon wanders across time. Grass and trees flourish in the forests in which it has appeared.','Ten Pokémon wędruje przez czas. W lasach, w których się pojawił, trawa i drzewa kwitną.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-4',1.7,0.5,'4');
INSERT INTO `tcg_card` VALUES ('sm11-40','Lumineon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',457,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/40.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/40_hires.png','Deep down at the bottom of the ocean, prey is scarce. Lumineon get into fierce disputes with Lanturn over food.','Głęboko na dnie oceanu, zdobycz jest rzadka. Lumineon wdaje się w zaciekłe spory z Lanturn o jedzenie.','Grass',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-40',0.14,0.02,'40'),('sm11-41','Snover',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Water',459,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/41.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/41_hires.png','During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain\'s lower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered summit in the spring.','W chłodne pory roku migruje do niższych partii gór. Na wiosnę powraca na pokryty śniegiem szczyt.','Metal',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-41',0.06,0.02,'41'),('sm11-42','Abomasnow',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Water',460,'sm11','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/42.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/42_hires.png','It blankets wide areas in snow by whipping up blizzards. It is also known as \"The Ice Monster.\"','Pokrywa duże obszary śniegiem, wywołując zamiecie śnieżne. Znany jest również jako Potwór Lodowy','Metal',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-42',0.33,0.05,'42'),('sm11-43','Basculin',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Water',550,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/43.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/43_hires.png','Savage, violent Pokémon, red and blue Basculin are always fighting each other over territory.','Dzikie, agresywne Pokémony, czerwone i niebieskie Basculin zawsze walczą ze sobą o terytorium.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-43',0.08,0.02,'43'),('sm11-44','Tirtouga',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Water',564,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/44.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/44_hires.png','It was restored from an ancient fossil. Tirtouga lived in the sea but came up onto the land to search for prey.','Zostało odtworzone ze starożytnej skamieliny. Tirtouga żył w morzu, ale wyszedł na ląd, aby szukać zdobyczy.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-44',0.17,0.02,'44'),('sm11-45','Carracosta',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Water',565,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/45.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/45_hires.png','Its jaws are terrifyingly powerful. It could eat Omastar and Omanyte whole and not be bothered in the slightest by their shells.','Jego szczęki są przerażająco potężne. Mógłby zjeść Omastar i Omanyte w całości i nie przejmować się w najmniejszym stopniu ich skorupami.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-45',0.2,0.02,'45'),('sm11-46','Cryogonal',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Water',615,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/46.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/46_hires.png','They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.','Rodzą się w chmurach śnieżnych. Używają łańcuchów z kryształków lodu, aby złapać ofiarę.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-46',0.05,0.02,'46'),('sm11-47','Keldeo-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,GX','Basic',170,'Water',647,'sm11','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/47.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/47_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-47',1.83,0.45,'47'),('sm11-48','Dewpider',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',751,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/48.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/48_hires.png','When two Dewpider meet, they display their water bubbles to each other. Then the one with the smaller bubble gets out of the other\'s way.','Gdy dwa Dewpidery się spotykają, pokazują sobie nawzajem swoje bąbelki wody. Wtedy ten z mniejszym bąbelkiem schodzi drugiemu z drogi.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-48',0.11,0.02,'48'),('sm11-49','Araquanid',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Water',752,'sm11','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/49.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/49_hires.png','It usually passes its time in the water. When its belly is full, it stores its subdued prey in the water bubble on its head.','Zazwyczaj spędza czas w wodzie. Kiedy jego brzuch jest pełny, przechowuje swoją obezwładnioną zdobycz w bańce wodnej na głowie.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-49',0.23,0.05,'49'),('sm11-5','Shroomish',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Grass',285,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/5.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/5_hires.png','It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head.','Preferuje miejsca wilgotne. W dzień pozostaje nieruchomo w cieniu lasu. Z głowy wydziela toksyczny proszek.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-5',0.05,0.02,'5'),('sm11-50','Wimpod',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',767,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/50.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/50_hires.png','It will pick up anything it finds on the ground. Sometimes it finds coins, so Murkrow and Meowth will go after it.','Podniesie wszystko, co znajdzie na ziemi. Czasami znajdzie monety, więc Murkrow i Meowth będą go ścigać.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-50',0.09,0.02,'50'),('sm11-51','Golisopod',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Water',768,'sm11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/51.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/51_hires.png','The shell covering its body is as hard as diamond. This Pokémon will do anything it takes to win.','Skorupa pokrywająca jego ciało jest twarda jak diament. Ten Pokémon zrobi wszystko, aby wygrać.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-51',0.64,0.2,'51'),('sm11-52','Pyukumuku',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Water',771,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/52.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/52_hires.png','The tradition known as Pyukumuku chucking started from the custom of throwing Pyukumuku back into the sea after they wash onshore.','Tradycja znana jako rzucanie Pyukumuku wywodzi się ze zwyczaju wrzucania Pyukumuku z powrotem do morza po tym, jak zostaną wyrzucone na brzeg.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-52',0.15,0.02,'52'),('sm11-53','Tapu Fini',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Water',788,'sm11','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/53.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/53_hires.png','This guardian deity of Poni Island manipulates water. Because it lives deep within a thick fog, it came to be both feared and revered.','To bóstwo opiekuńcze wyspy Poni manipuluje wodą. Ponieważ żyje głęboko w gęstej mgle, stało się zarówno obiektem strachu, jak i czci.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-53',0.51,0.05,'53'),('sm11-54','Raichu & Alolan Raichu-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,TAG TEAM,GX','Basic',260,'Lightning',26,'sm11','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/54.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/54_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-54',4.25,2,'54'),('sm11-55','Pikachu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Lightning',25,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/55.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/55_hires.png','Its nature is to store up electricity. Forests where nests of Pikachu live are dangerous, since the trees are so often struck by lightning.','Jego naturą jest gromadzenie elektryczności. Lasy, w których żyją gniazda Pikachu, są niebezpieczne, ponieważ drzewa są często uderzane przez pioruny.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-55',0.75,0.02,'55'),('sm11-56','Pikachu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',25,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/56.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/56_hires.png','Its nature is to store up electricity. Forests where nests of Pikachu live are dangerous, since the trees are so often struck by lightning.','Jego naturą jest gromadzenie elektryczności. Lasy, w których żyją gniazda Pikachu, są niebezpieczne, ponieważ drzewa są często uderzane przez pioruny.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-56',1.56,0.05,'56'),('sm11-57','Alolan Raichu',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Lightning',26,'sm11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/57.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/57_hires.png','It focuses psychic energy into its tail and rides it like it\'s surfing. Another name for this Pokémon is \"hodad.\"','Skupia energię psychiczną w ogonie i jeździ na nim jak na surfingu. Inna nazwa tego Pokémona to hodad','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-57',3.61,0.8,'57'),('sm11-58','Magnemite',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Lightning',81,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/58.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/58_hires.png','It\'s frequently the cause of power outages, which is why some power plants send out electrical signals that it can\'t stand.','To częsta przyczyna przerw w dostawie prądu, dlatego niektóre elektrownie wysyłają sygnały elektryczne, których nie są w stanie znieść.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-58',0.1,0.02,'58'),('sm11-59','Magneton',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Lightning',82,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/59.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/59_hires.png','Delicate equipment can malfunction in areas inhabited by Magneton, which send out mysterious electrical signals.','Delikatny sprzęt może ulec awarii w obszarach zamieszkanych przez Magnetony, które wysyłają tajemnicze sygnały elektryczne.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-59',0.09,0.02,'59'),('sm11-6','Sewaddle',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Grass',540,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/6.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/6_hires.png','This Pokémon makes clothes for itself. It chews up leaves and sews them with sticky thread extruded from its mouth.','Ten Pokémon robi sobie ubrania. Żuje liście i zszywa je lepką nicią, którą wyciska z pyska.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-6',0.07,0.02,'6'),('sm11-60','Magnezone',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Lightning',462,'sm11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/60_hires.png','It uses radar to monitor its territory. Intruders are quickly disposed of with a hyper beam.','Używa radaru do monitorowania swojego terytorium. Intruzów szybko eliminuje się za pomocą hiperwiązki.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-60',0.75,0.15,'60'),('sm11-61','Joltik',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Lightning',595,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/61_hires.png','Since it can\'t generate its own electricity, it sticks onto large-bodied Pokémon and absorbs static electricity.','Ponieważ nie może generować własnej energii elektrycznej, przyczepia się do Pokémonów o dużym ciele i pochłania elektryczność statyczną.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-61',0.08,0.02,'61'),('sm11-62','Galvantula',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Lightning',596,'sm11','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/62.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/62_hires.png','They employ an electrically charged web to trap their prey. While it is immobilized by shock, they leisurely consume it.','Używają naładowanej elektrycznie sieci, aby złapać swoją ofiarę. Podczas gdy jest ona unieruchomiona przez wstrząs, oni ją spokojnie konsumują.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-62',0.29,0.05,'62'),('sm11-63','Tynamo',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Lightning',602,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/63.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/63_hires.png','While one alone doesn\'t have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning.','Choć pojedynczy Tynamo nie ma wielkiej mocy, łańcuch wielu Tynamo może być tak potężny jak błyskawica.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-63',0.07,0.02,'63'),('sm11-64','Tynamo',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Lightning',602,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/64.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/64_hires.png','While one alone doesn\'t have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning.','Choć pojedynczy Tynamo nie ma wielkiej mocy, łańcuch wielu Tynamo może być tak potężny jak błyskawica.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-64',0.1,0.02,'64'),('sm11-65','Eelektrik',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Lightning',603,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/65.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/65_hires.png','It wraps itself around its prey and paralyzes it with electricity from the round spots on its sides. Then it chomps.','Owija się wokół swojej ofiary i paraliżuje ją elektrycznością z okrągłych punktów na bokach. Następnie gryzie.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-65',0.08,0.02,'65'),('sm11-66','Eelektross',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',150,'Lightning',604,'sm11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/66.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/66_hires.png','With their sucker mouths, they suck in prey. Then they use their fangs to shock the prey with electricity.','Za pomocą ssawek wsysają ofiarę. Następnie używają kłów, aby porazić ofiarę prądem elektrycznym.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-66',0.44,0.09,'66'),('sm11-67','Stunfisk',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Lightning',618,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/67.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/67_hires.png','Its skin is very hard, so it is unhurt even if stepped on by sumo wrestlers. It smiles when transmitting electricity.','Jego skóra jest bardzo twarda, więc nie jest ranna, nawet jeśli nadepną na nią zapaśnicy sumo. Uśmiecha się, gdy przekazuje elektryczność.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-67',0.05,0.02,'67'),('sm11-68','Thundurus',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Lightning',642,'sm11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/68.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/68_hires.png','The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of lightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off lightning bolts.','Kolce na jego ogonie wyrzucają ogromne błyskawice. Lata po regionie Unova, wystrzeliwując błyskawice.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-68',0.07,0.02,'68'),('sm11-69','Tapu Koko',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Lightning',785,'sm11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/69.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/69_hires.png','Although it\'s called a guardian deity, if a person or Pokémon puts it in a bad mood, it will become a malevolent deity and attack.','Chociaż nazywane jest bóstwem opiekuńczym, jeśli jakaś osoba lub Pokémon wprawi je w zły nastrój, stanie się ono złośliwym bóstwem i zaatakuje.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm11-69',0.32,0.1,'69'),('sm11-7','Sewaddle',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Grass',540,'sm11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/7.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm11/7_hires.png','This Pokémon makes clothes for itself. It chews up lea