und.','Przegryza się przez głazy swoimi mocnymi szczękami. Jego oczy widzą w ciemnościach pod ziemią.','Fire',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm7-89',1.83,0.5,'89'),('sm7-9','Grovyle',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Grass',253,'sm7','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/9.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/9_hires.png','It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.','Żyje w gęstych dżunglach. Zbliżając się do ofiary, skacze z gałęzi na gałąź.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm7-9',0.24,0.02,'9'),('sm7-90','Scizor-GX',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,GX','Stage 1',210,'Metal',212,'sm7','Rare Holo GX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/90.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/90_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm7-90',3.27,0.99,'90'),('sm7-91','Mawile',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Metal',303,'sm7','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/91.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/91_hires.png','Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.','Do jego głowy przymocowany jest ogromny zestaw szczęk utworzonych z rogów. Może przeżuwać żelazne belki.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm7-91',0.16,0.02,'91'),('sm7-92','Beldum',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Metal',374,'sm7','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/92.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/92_hires.png','With magnetic traction, it pulls its opponents in close. When they\'re in range, it slashes them with its rear claws.','Dzięki magnetycznej trakcji przyciąga przeciwników blisko. Gdy są w zasięgu, tnie ich tylnymi pazurami.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sm7-92',0.09,0.02,'92'),('sm7-93','Beldum',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Metal',374,'sm7','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/93.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm7/93_hires.png',