ting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-163',0.03,0.02,'163'),('sv1-164','Cyclizar',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Colorless',967,'sv1','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/164.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/164_hires.png','It can sprint at over 70 mph while carrying a human. The rider\'s body heat warms Cyclizar\'s back and lifts the Pokémon\'s spirit.','Może biec z prędkością ponad 70 mil na godzinę, przewożąc człowieka. Ciepło ciała jeźdźca ogrzewa plecy Cyclizara i podnosi ducha Pokémona.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-164',0.08,0.02,'164'),('sv1-165','Flamigo',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Colorless',973,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/165.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/165_hires.png','Thanks to a behavior of theirs known as \"synchronizing,\" an entire flock of these Pokémon can attack simultaneously in perfect harmony.','Dzięki ich zachowaniu znanemu jako \"synchronizacja\", całe stado tych Pokémonów może atakować jednocześnie w idealnej harmonii.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-165',0.03,0.02,'165'),('sv1-166','Arven',NULL,'Trainer','Supporter','Supporter',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/166.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/166_hires.png','Thanks to a behavior of theirs known as \"synchronizing,\" an entire flock of these Pokémon can attack simultaneously in perfect harmony.','Dzięki ich zachowaniu znanemu jako \"synchronizacja\", całe stado tych Pokémonów może atakować jednocześnie w idealnej harmonii.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-166',1.93,0.07,'166'),('sv1-167','Beach Court',NULL,'Trainer','Stadium','Stadium',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/167.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/167_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-167',0.08,0.02,'167'),('sv