INSERT INTO `tcg_card` VALUES ('sv1-194','Switch',NULL,'Trainer','Item','Item',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sv1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/194.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/194_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-194',0.11,0.02,'194'),('sv1-195','Team Star Grunt',NULL,'Trainer','Supporter','Supporter',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/195.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/195_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-195',0.05,0.02,'195'),('sv1-196','Ultra Ball',NULL,'Trainer','Item','Item',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/196.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/196_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-196',0.13,0.02,'196'),('sv1-197','Vitality Band',NULL,'Trainer','Pokémon Tool','Pokémon Tool',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/197.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/197_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-197',0.08,0.02,'197'),('sv1-198','Youngster',NULL,'Trainer','Supporter','Supporter',NULL,NULL,NULL,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/198.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/198_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-198',0.04,0.02,'198'),('sv1-199','Tarountula',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Grass',917,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/199.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/199_hires.png','The thread it secretes from its rear is as strong as wire. The secret behind the thread\'s strength is the topic of ongoing research.','Nić, którą wydziela z tyłu, jest tak mocna jak drut. Tajemnica siły nici jest przedmiotem trwających badań.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-199',5.7,2.5,'199'),('sv1-2','Heracross',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Grass',214,'sv1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/2.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/2_hires.png','With its herculean powers, it can easily throw around an object that is 100 times its own weight.','Dzięki swym herkulesowym mocom może z łatwością rzucać przedmiotem ważącym 100 razy więcej niż on sam.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-2',0.04,0.02,'2'),('sv1-20','Smoliv',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Grass',928,'sv1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/20.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/20_hires.png','It protects itself from enemies by emitting oil from the fruit on its head. This oil is bitter and astringent enough to make someone flinch.','Ochrona przed wrogami polega na wydzielaniu oleju z owocu na głowie. Olej ten jest gorzki i wystarczająco cierpki, by wywołać drgnięcie.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-20',0.05,0.02,'20'),('sv1-200','Dolliv',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Grass',929,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/200.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/200_hires.png','Dolliv shares its tasty, fresh-scented oil with others. This species has coexisted with humans since times long gone.','Dolliv dzieli się swoim smacznym, świeżo pachnącym olejem z innymi. Gatunek ten współistnieje z ludźmi od zamierzchłych czasów.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-200',4.7,1.99,'200'),('sv1-201','Toedscool',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Grass',948,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/201.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/201_hires.png','Though it looks like Tentacool, Toedscool is a completely different species. Its legs may be thin, but it can run at a speed of 30 mph.','Choć wygląda jak Tentacool, Toedscool jest zupełnie innym gatunkiem. Jego nogi mogą być cienkie, ale może biec z prędkością 30 mil na godzinę.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-201',4.56,2.75,'201'),('sv1-202','Scovillain',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Grass',952,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/202.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/202_hires.png','The green head has turned vicious due to the spicy chemicals stimulating its brain. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it.','Zielona głowa stała się okrutna z powodu pikantnych chemikaliów stymulujących jej mózg. Gdy raz zacznie szaleć, nie da się jej powstrzymać.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-202',4.17,1.99,'202'),('sv1-203','Armarouge',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Fire',936,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/203.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/203_hires.png','Armarouge evolved through the use of a set of armor that belonged to a distinguished warrior. This Pokémon is incredibly loyal.','Armarouge ewoluował dzięki użyciu zestawu zbroi należącego do wybitnego wojownika. Ten Pokémon jest niesamowicie lojalny.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-203',10.54,6,'203'),('sv1-204','Slowpoke',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',79,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/204.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/204_hires.png','It is always vacantly lost in thought, but no one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail.','Zawsze jest bezmyślnie zamyślony, ale nikt nie wie, o czym myśli. Dobrze mu idzie łowienie ryb ogonem.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-204',16.39,11.99,'204'),('sv1-205','Clauncher',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',692,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/205.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/205_hires.png','Clauncher\'s claws will regrow if they fall off. The meat inside the claws is edible, but it has a distinct flavor that doesn\'t appeal to all tastes.','Pazury Claunchera odrosną, jeśli odpadną. Mięso w środku pazurów jest jadalne, ale ma charakterystyczny smak, który nie każdemu przypadnie do gustu.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-205',4.7,1.55,'205'),('sv1-206','Wiglett',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Water',960,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/206.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/206_hires.png','This Pokémon can pick up the scent of a Veluza just over 65 feet away and will hide itself in the sand.','Ten Pokémon potrafi wyczuć zapach Veluzy z odległości zaledwie 65 stóp i ukryć się w piasku.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-206',5.58,2.89,'206'),('sv1-207','Dondozo',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',160,'Water',977,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/207.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/207_hires.png','This Pokémon is a glutton, but it\'s bad at getting food. It teams up with a Tatsugiri to catch prey.','Ten Pokémon jest żarłokiem, ale nie radzi sobie ze zdobywaniem pożywienia. Współpracuje z Tatsugiri, aby złapać ofiarę.','Lightning',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-207',8.94,4,'207'),('sv1-208','Pachirisu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',417,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/208.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/208_hires.png','A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.','Można zobaczyć parę, która pociera o siebie policzki, próbując podzielić się zgromadzoną energią elektryczną.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-208',9.33,5.44,'208'),('sv1-209','Pawmot',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',130,'Lightning',922,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/209.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/209_hires.png','Pawmot\'s fluffy fur acts as a battery. It can store the same amount of electricity as an electric car.','Puszyste futro Pawmota działa jak bateria. Może przechowywać taką samą ilość energii elektrycznej jak samochód elektryczny.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-209',5.31,1.98,'209'),('sv1-21','Smoliv',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Grass',928,'sv1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/21.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/21_hires.png','It protects itself from enemies by emitting oil from the fruit on its head. This oil is bitter and astringent enough to make someone flinch.','Ochrona przed wrogami polega na wydzielaniu oleju z owocu na głowie. Olej ten jest gorzki i wystarczająco cierpki, by wywołać drgnięcie.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-21',0.05,0.02,'21'),('sv1-210','Drowzee',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',96,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/210.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/210_hires.png','When it twitches its nose, it can tell where someone is sleeping and what that person is dreaming about.','Kiedy porusza nosem, potrafi stwierdzić, gdzie ktoś śpi i o czym śni.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-210',30.04,19.49,'210'),('sv1-211','Ralts',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',280,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/211.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/211_hires.png','The horns on its head provide a strong power that enables it to sense people\'s emotions.','Rogi na jego głowie zapewniają mu silną moc, która pozwala mu wyczuwać ludzkie emocje.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-211',27.25,17.75,'211'),('sv1-212','Kirlia',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',281,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/212.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/212_hires.png','It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.','Posiada moc psychiczną, która pozwala mu zniekształcać przestrzeń wokół siebie i widzieć przyszłość.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-212',25.09,13,'212'),('sv1-213','Fidough',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Psychic',926,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/213.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/213_hires.png','This Pokémon is smooth and moist to the touch. Yeast in Fidough\'s breath induces fermentation in the Pokémon\'s vicinity.','Ten Pokémon jest gładki i wilgotny w dotyku. Drożdże w oddechu Fidougha wywołują fermentację w pobliżu Pokémona.','Metal',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-213',7.46,2.9,'213'),('sv1-214','Greavard',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',971,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/214.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/214_hires.png','This friendly Pokémon doesn\'t like being alone. Pay it even the slightest bit of attention, and it will follow you forever.','Ten przyjazny Pokémon nie lubi być sam. Poświęć mu choć odrobinę uwagi, a będzie za tobą podążał na zawsze.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-214',9.45,6.9,'214'),('sv1-215','Riolu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fighting',447,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/215.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/215_hires.png','They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night.','Komunikują się ze sobą za pomocą swoich aur. Potrafią biegać przez całą noc.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-215',15.15,10,'215'),('sv1-216','Sandile',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fighting',551,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/216.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/216_hires.png','It submerges itself in sand and moves as if swimming. This wise behavior keeps its enemies from finding it and maintains its temperature.','Zanurza się w piasku i porusza się, jakby pływał. To mądre zachowanie uniemożliwia wrogom znalezienie go i utrzymuje jego temperaturę.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-216',5.35,2,'216'),('sv1-217','Klawf',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',130,'Fighting',950,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/217.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/217_hires.png','Klawf hangs upside-down from cliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf can\'t remain in this position for long because its blood rushes to its head.','Klawf wisi głową w dół na klifach, czekając na ofiarę. Ale Klawf nie może pozostać w tej pozycji zbyt długo, ponieważ krew uderza mu do głowy.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-217',4.41,1.9,'217'),('sv1-218','Mabosstiff',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Darkness',943,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/218.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/218_hires.png','Mabosstiff loves playing with children. Though usually gentle, it takes on an intimidating look when protecting its family.','Mabosstiff uwielbia bawić się z dziećmi. Choć zwykle łagodny, przybiera groźny wygląd, gdy chroni swoją rodzinę.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-218',4.9,2.5,'218'),('sv1-219','Bombirdier',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Darkness',962,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/219.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/219_hires.png','Bombirdier uses the apron on its chest to bundle up food, which it carries back to its nest. It enjoys dropping things that make loud noises.','Bombirdier używa fartucha na piersi do pakowania jedzenia, które niesie z powrotem do gniazda. Lubi zrzucać rzeczy, które wydają głośne dźwięki.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-219',4.35,1.99,'219'),('sv1-22','Dolliv',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Grass',929,'sv1','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/22.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/22_hires.png','Dolliv shares its tasty, fresh-scented oil with others. This species has coexisted with humans since times long gone.','Dolliv dzieli się swoim smacznym, świeżo pachnącym olejem z innymi. Gatunek ten współistnieje z ludźmi od zamierzchłych czasów.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-22',0.04,0.02,'22'),('sv1-220','Kingambit',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',170,'Darkness',983,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/220.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/220_hires.png','Only a Bisharp that stands above all others in its vast army can evolve into Kingambit.','Tylko Bisharp, który góruje nad wszystkimi innymi w swojej ogromnej armii, może ewoluować w Kingambita.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-220',6.07,2,'220'),('sv1-221','Starly',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Colorless',396,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/221.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/221_hires.png','They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying.','Gromadzą się wokół gór i pól, goniąc za Pokémonami-robakami. Ich śpiew jest głośny i irytujący.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-221',8.11,3.99,'221'),('sv1-222','Skwovet',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Colorless',819,'sv1','Illustration Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/222.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/222_hires.png','No matter how much it stuffs its belly with food, it is always anxious about getting hungry again. So, it stashes berries in its cheeks and tail.','Bez względu na to, jak bardzo napycha sobie brzuch jedzeniem, zawsze boi się, że znowu zgłodnieje. Dlatego chowa jagody w policzkach i ogonie.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv1-222',4.94,1.5,'222'),('sv1-223','Spidops ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,ex','Stage 1',260,'Grass',918,'sv1','Ultra Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv1/223.png','https://imag