sv3/92.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/92_hires.png','It was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep.','Odkryto go w miejscu uderzenia meteorytu 40 lat temu. Jego spojrzenie potrafi uśpić wrogów.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3-92',0.03,0.02,'92'),('sv3-93','Solrock',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Psychic',338,'sv3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/93.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/93_hires.png','Solar energy is the source of its power, so it is strong during the daytime. When it spins, its body shines.','Źródłem jego mocy jest energia słoneczna, więc jest silny w ciągu dnia. Kiedy się obraca, jego ciało świeci.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3-93',0.04,0.02,'93'),('sv3-94','Baltoy',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',343,'sv3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/94.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/94_hires.png','It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.','Odkryto go w starożytnych ruinach. Podczas ruchu stale się obraca. Stoi na jednej nodze, nawet gdy śpi.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3-94',0.03,0.02,'94'),('sv3-95','Claydol',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Psychic',344,'sv3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/95.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/95_hires.png','It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move.','Wydaje się, że narodziło się z glinianych lalek wykonanych przez starożytnych ludzi. Używa telekinezy, aby unosić się i poruszać.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3-95',0.05,0.02,'95'),('sv3-96','Vespiquen ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,ex,Tera','Stage 1',270,'Psychic',416,'sv3','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/96.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3/96_