nemy, it charges furiously while whipping its body with its long tails.','Kiedy atakuje wroga, szarżuje z wściekłością, jednocześnie smagając swoje ciało długimi ogonami.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-128',0.05,0.02,'128'),('sv3pt5-129','Magikarp',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Water',129,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/129.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/129_hires.png','An underpowered, pathetic Pokémon. It may jump high on rare occasions but never more than seven feet.','Słabo wyposażony, żałosny Pokémon. Może skakać wysoko w rzadkich przypadkach, ale nigdy nie wyżej niż siedem stóp.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-129',0.04,0.02,'129'),('sv3pt5-13','Weedle',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Grass',13,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/13.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/13_hires.png','Its poison stinger is very powerful. Its bright-colored body is intended to warn off its enemies.','Jego jadowite żądło jest bardzo silne. Jego jaskrawe ciało ma za zadanie ostrzegać wrogów.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-13',0.04,0.02,'13'),('sv3pt5-130','Gyarados',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',190,'Water',130,'sv3pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/130.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/130_hires.png','Once it appears, it goes on a rampage. It remains enraged until it demolishes everything around it.','Gdy się pojawi, wpada w szał. Pozostaje wściekły, dopóki nie zniszczy wszystkiego wokół siebie.','Lightning',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-130',0.14,0.02,'130'),('sv3pt5-131','Lapras',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Water',131,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/131.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/131_hires.png','Crossing icy seas is no issue for this cold-resistant Pokémon. Its smooth skin is a little cool to 