.io/sv3pt5/39.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/39_hires.png','When its huge eyes waver, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.','Kiedy jego wielkie oczy się chwieją, śpiewa tajemniczo kojącą melodię, która usypia jego wrogów.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-39',0.04,0.02,'39'),('sv3pt5-4','Charmander',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fire',4,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/4.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/4_hires.png','From the time it is born, a flame burns at the tip of its tail. Its life would end if the flame were to go out.','Od momentu narodzin płomień pali się na czubku jego ogona. Jego życie skończyłoby się, gdyby płomień zgasł.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-4',69.91,0.1,'4'),('sv3pt5-40','Wigglytuff ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,ex','Stage 1',250,'Colorless',40,'sv3pt5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/40.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/40_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-40',1.14,0.2,'40'),('sv3pt5-41','Zubat',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Darkness',41,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/41.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/41_hires.png','Zubat live in caves, down where the sun\'s light won\'t reach. In the morning, they gather together to keep each other warm as they sleep.','Zubatowie mieszkają w jaskiniach, gdzie nie dociera światło słoneczne. Rano zbierają się razem, aby się ogrzać podczas snu.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-41',0.03,0.02,'41'),('sv3pt5-42','Golbat',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Darkness',42,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/42.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/42_hires.png','Its feet are tiny, but this Pokémon walks skillfully. It sneaks up on sleeping prey before sinking in its fangs and slurping up blood.','Jego stopy są maleńkie, ale ten Pokémon chodzi zręcznie. Podkrada się do śpiącej ofiary, zanim zatopi w niej kły i zacznie chłeptać krew.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-42',0.04,0.02,'42'),('sv3pt5-43','Oddish',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Grass',43,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/43.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/43_hires.png','During the day, it stays in the cold underground to avoid the sun. It grows by bathing in moonlight.','W ciągu dnia przebywa w zimnie pod ziemią, aby uniknąć słońca. Rośnie, kąpiąc się w świetle księżyca.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-43',0.03,0.02,'43'),('sv3pt5-44','Gloom',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',70,'Grass',44,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/44.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/44_hires.png','What appears to be drool is actually sweet honey. It is very sticky and clings stubbornly if touched.','To, co wygląda jak ślina, jest w rzeczywistości słodkim miodem. Jest bardzo lepki i uporczywie przylega, gdy się go dotknie.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-44',0.04,0.02,'44'),('sv3pt5-45','Vileplume',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',140,'Grass',45,'sv3pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/45.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/45_hires.png','The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up.','Im większe płatki, tym więcej toksycznego pyłku zawiera. Jego duża głowa jest ciężka i trudna do utrzymania.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-45',0.14,0.02,'45'),('sv3pt5-46','Paras',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Grass',46,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/46.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/46_hires.png','The mushrooms, known as tochukaso, are controlling the bug. Even if the bug bugs the mushrooms, they tell it to bug off.','Grzyby, znane jako tochukaso, kontrolują insekta. Nawet jeśli insekt zaatakuje grzyby, każą mu się odczepić.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-46',0.04,0.02,'46'),('sv3pt5-47','Parasect',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Grass',47,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/47.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/47_hires.png','The bug is mostly dead, with the mushroom on its back having become the main body. If the mushroom comes off, the bug stops moving.','Robak jest w większości martwy, a grzyb na jego grzbiecie stał się głównym ciałem. Jeśli grzyb odpadnie, robak przestaje się ruszać.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-47',0.05,0.02,'47'),('sv3pt5-48','Venonat',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Grass',48,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/48.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/48_hires.png','Poison oozes from all over its body. It catches small bug Pokémon at night that are attracted by light.','Trucizna wycieka z całego jego ciała. Łapie małe Pokémony robaki w nocy, które są przyciągane przez światło.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-48',0.04,0.02,'48'),('sv3pt5-49','Venomoth',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Grass',49,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/49.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/49_hires.png','The wings are covered with dustlike scales. Every time it flaps its wings, it looses highly toxic dust.','Skrzydła pokryte są pyłopodobnymi łuskami. Za każdym razem, gdy trzepocze skrzydłami, traci wysoce toksyczny pył.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-49',0.05,0.02,'49'),('sv3pt5-5','Charmeleon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Fire',5,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/5.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/5_hires.png','If it becomes agitated during battle, it spouts intense flames, incinerating its surroundings.','Jeśli w czasie bitwy stanie się niespokojny, zieje intensywnym płomieniem, który podpala otoczenie.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-5',0.08,0.02,'5'),('sv3pt5-50','Diglett',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Fighting',50,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/50.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/50_hires.png','It lives about one yard underground, where it feeds on plant roots. It sometimes appears aboveground.','Żyje około jednego jarda pod ziemią, gdzie żywi się korzeniami roślin. Czasami pojawia się nad ziemią.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-50',0.04,0.02,'50'),('sv3pt5-51','Dugtrio',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Fighting',51,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/51.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/51_hires.png','Its three heads bob separately up and down to loosen the soil nearby, making it easier for it to burrow.','Jego trzy głowy poruszają się niezależnie w górę i w dół, aby spulchnić pobliską glebę, dzięki czemu łatwiej mu się zakopać.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-51',0.05,0.02,'51'),('sv3pt5-52','Meowth',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Colorless',52,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/52.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/52_hires.png','All it does is sleep during the daytime. At night, it patrols its territory with its eyes aglow.','Wszystko, co robi, to śpi w ciągu dnia. W nocy patroluje swoje terytorium z rozświetlonymi oczami.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-52',0.04,0.02,'52'),('sv3pt5-53','Persian',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Colorless',53,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/53.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/53_hires.png','Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness.','Chociaż jego futro ma wielu wielbicieli, trudno go wychować jako zwierzę domowe ze względu na jego kapryśną złośliwość.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-53',0.05,0.02,'53'),('sv3pt5-54','Psyduck',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',54,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/54.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/54_hires.png','It is constantly wracked by a headache. When the headache turns intense, it begins using mysterious powers.','Ciągle dręczy go ból głowy. Kiedy ból głowy staje się intensywny, zaczyna używać tajemniczych mocy.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-54',0.04,0.02,'54'),('sv3pt5-55','Golduck',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Water',55,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/55.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/55_hires.png','When it swims at full speed using its long, webbed limbs, its forehead somehow begins to glow.','Kiedy pływa z pełną prędkością, używając swoich długich, błoniastych kończyn, jego czoło zaczyna w jakiś sposób świecić.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-55',0.05,0.02,'55'),('sv3pt5-56','Mankey',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fighting',56,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/56.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/56_hires.png','It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness.','Żyje w grupach na czubkach drzew. Jeśli straci z oczu swoją grupę, wpada we wściekłość z powodu samotności.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-56',0.03,0.02,'56'),('sv3pt5-57','Primeape',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Fighting',57,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/57.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/57_hires.png','It becomes wildly furious if it even senses someone looking at it. It chases anyone that meets its glare.','Staje się wściekła, nawet jeśli wyczuje, że ktoś na nią patrzy. Goni każdego, kto napotka jej wzrok.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-57',0.04,0.02,'57'),('sv3pt5-58','Growlithe',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Fire',58,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/58.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/58_hires.png','It has a brave and trustworthy nature. It fearlessly stands up to bigger and stronger foes.','Ma odważną i godną zaufania naturę. Bez strachu stawia czoła większym i silniejszym wrogom.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-58',0.04,0.02,'58'),('sv3pt5-59','Arcanine',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',150,'Fire',59,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/59.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/59_hires.png','An ancient picture scroll shows that people were captivated by its movement as it ran through prairies.','Starożytny zwój z obrazkami pokazuje, że ludzie byli zafascynowani jego ruchem, gdy przebiegał przez prerie.','Water',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-59',0.06,0.02,'59'),('sv3pt5-6','Charizard ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,ex','Stage 2',330,'Fire',6,'sv3pt5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/6.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/6_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-6',6.09,3,'6'),('sv3pt5-60','Poliwag',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',60,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/60_hires.png','In rivers with fast-flowing water, this Pokémon will cling to a rock by using its thick lips, which act like a suction cup.','W rzekach o szybkim nurcie ten Pokémon będzie przyczepiał się do skały za pomocą swoich grubych warg, które działają jak przyssawka.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-60',0.04,0.02,'60'),('sv3pt5-61','Poliwhirl',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',61,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/61_hires.png','This Pokémon\'s sweat is a slimy mucus. When captured, Poliwhirl can slither from its enemies\' grasp and escape.','Pot tego Pokémona to śliski śluz. Po złapaniu Poliwhirl może wyślizgnąć się z rąk wrogów i uciec.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-61',0.1,0.02,'61'),('sv3pt5-62','Poliwrath',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Water',62,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/62.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/62_hires.png','Poliwrath is skilled at both swimming and martial arts. It uses its well-trained arms to dish out powerful punches.','Poliwrath jest biegły zarówno w pływaniu, jak i sztukach walki. Używa swoich dobrze wyszkolonych ramion, aby zadawać potężne ciosy.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-62',0.05,0.02,'62'),('sv3pt5-63','Abra',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Psychic',63,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/63.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/63_hires.png','Abra can teleport in its sleep. Apparently the more deeply Abra sleeps, the farther its teleportations go.','Abra potrafi teleportować się we śnie. Najwyraźniej im głębiej Abra śpi, tym dalej sięgają jej teleportacje.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-63',0.04,0.02,'63'),('sv3pt5-64','Kadabra',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Psychic',64,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/64.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/64_hires.png','This Pokémon\'s telekinesis is immensely powerful. To prepare for evolution, Kadabra stores up psychic energy in the star on its forehead.','Telekineza tego Pokémona jest niezwykle potężna. Aby przygotować się do ewolucji, Kadabra gromadzi energię psychiczną w gwieździe na swoim czole.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-64',0.21,0.02,'64'),('sv3pt5-65','Alakazam ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,ex','Stage 2',310,'Psychic',65,'sv3pt5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/65.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/65_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-65',1.81,0.35,'65'),('sv3pt5-66','Machop',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fighting',66,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/66.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/66_hires.png','Always brimming with power, it passes time by lifting boulders. Doing so makes it even stronger.','Zawsze pełen mocy, zabija czas podnosząc głazy. Robiąc to, staje się jeszcze silniejszy.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-66',0.04,0.02,'66'),('sv3pt5-67','Machoke',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Fighting',67,'sv3pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/67.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/67_hires.png','Its formidable body never gets tired. It helps people by doing work such as the moving of heavy goods.','Jego potężne ciało nigdy się nie męczy. Pomaga ludziom, wykonując prace takie jak przenoszenie ciężkich towarów.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-67',0.05,0.02,'67'),('sv3pt5-68','Machamp',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',180,'Fighting',68,'sv3pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/68.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/68_hires.png','With four arms that react more quickly than it can think, it can execute many punches at once.','Dzięki czterem ramionom, które reagują szybciej, niż myśli, może wykonać wiele ciosów na raz.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv3pt5-68',0.16,0.02,'68'),('sv3pt5-69','Bellsprout',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Grass',69,'sv3pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/69.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv3pt5/69_hires.png','Its bud looks like a human 