','Łapie wrogów za pomocą przyssawek, a następnie miażdży ich swoją twardą jak skała głową.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-34',0.04,0.02,'34'),('sv4-35','Feebas',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Water',349,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/35.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/35_hires.png','It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.','To obskurny i brzydki Pokémon. Jest jednak bardzo wytrzymały i może przetrwać przy małej ilości wody.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-35',0.03,0.02,'35'),('sv4-36','Milotic',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Water',350,'sv4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/36.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/36_hires.png','It\'s said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you\'re feeling.','Mówi się, że spojrzenie na Milotica i jego piękno ukoi wszelkie wrogie emocje, które odczuwasz.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-36',0.07,0.02,'36'),('sv4-37','Snorunt',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',361,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/37.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/37_hires.png','It is said that several Snorunt gather under giant leaves and live together in harmony.','Mówi się, że kilku Snoruntów zbiera się pod gigantycznymi liśćmi i żyje razem w harmonii.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-37',0.05,0.02,'37'),('sv4-38','Garchomp ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,Tera,ex','Stage 2',320,'Water',445,'sv4','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/38.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/38_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Lightning',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-38',1.25,0.5,'38'),('sv4-39','Mantyke',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Water',458,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/39.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/39_hires.png','It swims along with a school of Remoraid, and they\'ll all fight together to repel attackers.','Płynie wraz ze ławicą Remoraidów i wszyscy będą walczyć razem, aby odeprzeć atakujących.','Lightning',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-39',0.03,0.02,'39'),('sv4-4','Pansage',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Grass',511,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/4.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/4_hires.png','It\'s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It\'s kind enough to share them with friends.','Jest dobry w znajdowaniu jagód i zbiera je zewsząd. Jest na tyle miły, że dzieli się nimi ze znajomymi.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-4',0.03,0.02,'4'),('sv4-40','Palkia',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',130,'Water',484,'sv4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/40.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/40_hires.png','It has the ability to distort space. It is described as a deity in Sinnoh-region mythology.','Ma zdolność zniekształcania przestrzeni. Jest opisywany jako bóstwo w mitologii regionu Sinnoh.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-40',0.07,0.02,'40'),('sv4-41','Panpour',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',515,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/41.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/41_hires.png','The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large.','Woda zgromadzona w kępce na jego głowie jest pełna składników odżywczych. Rośliny, które otrzymują jej wodę, rosną duże.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-41',0.03,0.02,'41'),('sv4-42','Simipour',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Water',516,'sv4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/42.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/42_hires.png','It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail.','Preferu