ący na jego głowie jest bardzo gorzki.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-5',0.03,0.02,'5'),('sv4-50','Golisopod ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,ex','Stage 1',270,'Water',768,'sv4','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/50.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/50_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Lightning',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-50',0.63,0.1,'50'),('sv4-51','Wiglett',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Water',960,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/51.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/51_hires.png','This Pokémon can pick up the scent of a Veluza just over 65 feet away and will hide itself in the sand.','Ten Pokémon potrafi wyczuć zapach Veluzy z odległości zaledwie 65 stóp i ukryć się w piasku.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-51',0.03,0.02,'51'),('sv4-52','Wiglett',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',960,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/52.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/52_hires.png','This Pokémon can pick up the scent of a Veluza just over 65 feet away and will hide itself in the sand.','Ten Pokémon potrafi wyczuć zapach Veluzy z odległości zaledwie 65 stóp i ukryć się w piasku.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-52',0.03,0.02,'52'),('sv4-53','Wugtrio',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',961,'sv4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/53.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/53_hires.png','It has a vicious temperament, contrary to what its appearance may suggest. It wraps its long bodies around prey, then drags the prey into its den.','Ma okrutny temperament, wbrew temu, co może sugerować jego wygląd. Owija swoje długie ciała wokół ofiary, a następnie wciąga ją do swojej nory.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-53',0.04,0.02,'53'),('sv4-54','Veluza',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Water',976,'sv4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontc