','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/58.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/58_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-58',2.18,0.45,'58'),('sv4-59','Elekid',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Lightning',239,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/59.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/59_hires.png','It\'s not good at storing electricity yet. This Pokémon sneaks into people\'s homes, looking for electrical outlets to eat electricity from.','Jeszcze nie jest dobry w magazynowaniu prądu. Ten Pokémon zakrada się do domów ludzi, szukając gniazdek elektrycznych, z których mógłby pobierać prąd.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-59',0.04,0.02,'59'),('sv4-6','Dwebble',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Grass',557,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/6.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/6_hires.png','It first tries to find a rock to live in, but if there are no suitable rocks to be found, Dwebble may move in to the ports of a Hippowdon.','Najpierw próbuje znaleźć skałę, w której mógłby zamieszkać, ale jeśli nie ma odpowiednich skał, Dwebble może przenieść się do portów Hippowdona.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-6',0.02,0.02,'6'),('sv4-60','Plusle',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',311,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/60_hires.png','It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises.','Pobiera prąd ze słupów telefonicznych. Zwiera swoje ciało, co powoduje trzaski.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-60',0.04,0.02,'60'),('sv4-61','Minun',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',312,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/61_hires.png','It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more 