kémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fighting',619,'sv4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/96.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/96_hires.png','Though small, Mienfoo\'s temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of graceful attacks.','Mienfoo, choć mały, ma dziki temperament. Każde stworzenie, które nieostrożnie zbliży się do Mienfoo, zostanie przywitane gradem wdzięcznych ataków.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-96',0.03,0.02,'96'),('sv4-97','Mienshao',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Fighting',620,'sv4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/97.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/97_hires.png','Delivered at blinding speeds, kicks from this Pokémon can shatter massive boulders into tiny pieces.','Kopnięcia tego Pokémona wykonywane z oszałamiającą prędkością potrafią rozbić ogromne głazy na drobne kawałki.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-97',0.03,0.02,'97'),('sv4-98','Hoopa ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Tera,ex','Basic',220,'Fighting',720,'sv4','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/98.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/98_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-98',0.99,0.3,'98'),('sv4-99','Minior',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fighting',774,'sv4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/99.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4/99_hires.png','This is its form when its shell has fallen off. The color of its core depends on the materials that made up the food it ate.','Tak wygląda, gdy skorupa odpadnie. Kolor rdzenia zależy od materiałów, z których składało się pożywienie, które zjadł.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4-99',0.03,0.02,'99'),('sv4pt5-1','Pineco',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Grass',204,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/1.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/1_hires.png','It likes 