 one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail.','Zawsze jest bezmyślnie zamyślony, ale nikt nie wie, o czym myśli. Dobrze mu idzie łowienie ryb ogonem.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-116',5.42,3.5,'116'),('sv4pt5-117','Slowbro',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Water',80,'sv4pt5','Shiny Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/117.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/117_hires.png','If the tail-biting Shellder is thrown off in a harsh battle, this Pokémon reverts to being an ordinary Slowpoke.','Jeśli gryzący ogon Shellder zostanie wyrzucony w ciężkiej walce, Pokémon ten powraca do bycia zwykłym Slowpoke\'iem.','Lightning',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-117',4.63,2.99,'117'),('sv4pt5-118','Staryu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',120,'sv4pt5','Shiny Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/118.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/118_hires.png','Fish Pokémon nibble at it, but Staryu isn\'t bothered. Its body regenerates quickly, even if part of it is completely torn off.','Pokémony rybne go skubią, ale Staryu się tym nie przejmuje. Jego ciało regeneruje się szybko, nawet jeśli część zostanie całkowicie oderwana.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-118',3.88,2.5,'118'),('sv4pt5-119','Starmie',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',121,'sv4pt5','Shiny Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/119.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/119_hires.png','Starmie swims by spinning its body at high speed. As this Pokémon cruises through the ocean, it absorbs tiny plankton.','Starmie pływa, obracając swoje ciało z dużą prędkością. Gdy ten Pokémon płynie przez ocean, pochłania drobny plankton.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-119',3.91,2.5,'119'),('sv4pt5-12','Camerupt',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Fire',323,'sv4pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontc