t5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/27.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/27_hires.png','The horns on its head provide a strong power that enables it to sense people\'s emotions.','Rogi na jego głowie zapewniają mu silną moc, która pozwala mu wyczuwać ludzkie emocje.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-27',0.06,0.02,'27'),('sv4pt5-28','Kirlia',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',281,'sv4pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/28.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/28_hires.png','It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.','Posiada moc psychiczną, która pozwala mu zniekształcać przestrzeń wokół siebie i widzieć przyszłość.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-28',0.06,0.02,'28'),('sv4pt5-29','Gardevoir ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,ex','Stage 2',310,'Psychic',282,'sv4pt5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/29.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/29_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-29',0.88,0.09,'29'),('sv4pt5-3','Maractus',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Grass',556,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/3.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/3_hires.png','Once each year, this Pokémon scatters its seeds. They\'re jam-packed with nutrients, making them a precious food source out in the desert.','Raz w roku ten Pokémon rozrzuca swoje nasiona. Są one wypełnione po brzegi składnikami odżywczymi, co czyni je cennym źródłem pożywienia na pustyni.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-3',0.02,0.02,'3'),('sv4pt5-30','Chimecho',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',358,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/30.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/30_hires.png','Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.','Emitując ultr