nę, która jest wysoko ceniona przez wiele luksusowych marek.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-34',0.02,0.02,'34'),('sv4pt5-35','Whimsicott',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',547,'sv4pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/35.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/35_hires.png','As long as this Pokémon bathes in sunlight, its cotton keeps growing. If too much cotton fluff builds up, Whimsicott tears it off and scatters it.','Dopóki ten Pokémon kąpie się w słońcu, jego bawełna rośnie. Jeśli nagromadzi się zbyt dużo bawełnianego puchu, Whimsicott zrywa go i rozrzuca.','Metal',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-35',0.03,0.02,'35'),('sv4pt5-36','Dedenne',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',702,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/36.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/36_hires.png','It\'s small and its electricity-generating organ is not fully developed, so it uses its tail to absorb electricity from people\'s homes and charge itself.','Jest mały, a jego organ wytwarzający prąd nie jest w pełni rozwinięty, więc używa ogona do pobierania prądu z domów ludzi i ładowania się.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-36',0.03,0.02,'36'),('sv4pt5-37','Mimikyu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',778,'sv4pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/37.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/37_hires.png','This Pokémon lives in dark places untouched by sunlight. When it appears before humans, it hides itself under a cloth that resembles a Pikachu.','Ten Pokémon żyje w ciemnych miejscach, których nie dotyka światło słoneczne. Kiedy pojawia się przed ludźmi, chowa się pod materiałem przypominającym Pikachu.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-37',0.1,0.02,'37'),('sv4pt5-38','Fidough',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Psychic',926,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/38.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/38_hires.png','This Pokémon is smooth and moist to the touch. Yeast in Fidough\'s breath induces fermentation in the Pokémon\'s vicinity.','Ten Pokémon jest gładki i wilgotny w dotyku. Drożdże w oddechu Fidougha wywołują fermentację w pobliżu Pokémona.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-38',0.03,0.02,'38'),('sv4pt5-39','Dachsbun',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',927,'sv4pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/39.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/39_hires.png','The pleasant aroma that emanates from this Pokémon\'s body helps wheat grow, so Dachsbun has been treasured by farming villages.','Przyjemny zapach wydobywający się z ciała tego Pokémona wspomaga wzrost pszenicy, dlatego Dachsbun jest ceniony przez wioski rolnicze.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-39',0.03,0.02,'39'),('sv4pt5-4','Toedscool',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Grass',948,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/4.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/4_hires.png','Though it looks like Tentacool, Toedscool is a completely different species. Its legs may be thin, but it can run at a speed of 30 mph.','Choć wygląda jak Tentacool, Toedscool jest zupełnie innym gatunkiem. Jego nogi mogą być cienkie, ale może biec z prędkością 30 mil na godzinę.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-4',0.02,0.02,'4'),('sv4pt5-40','Ceruledge',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Psychic',937,'sv4pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/40.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/40_hires.png','The fiery blades on its arms burn fiercely with the lingering resentment of a sword wielder who fell before accomplishing their goal.','Ogniste ostrza na jego ramionach płoną gwałtownie, z wciąż odczuwaną urazą miecznika, który poległ, zanim osiągnął swój cel.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-40',0.06,0.02,'40'),('sv4pt5-41','Flittle',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',30,'Psychic',955,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/41.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/41_hires.png','Flittle\'s toes levitate about half an inch above the ground because of the psychic power emitted from the frills on the Pokémon\'s belly.','Palce u stóp Flittle\'a unoszą się około pół cala nad ziemią dzięki mocy psychicznej emitowanej przez falbanki na brzuchu Pokémona.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-41',0.02,0.02,'41'),('sv4pt5-42','Greavard',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',971,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/42.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/42_hires.png','This friendly Pokémon doesn\'t like being alone. Pay it even the slightest bit of attention, and it will follow you forever.','Ten przyjazny Pokémon nie lubi być sam. Poświęć mu choć odrobinę uwagi, a będzie za tobą podążał na zawsze.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-42',0.02,0.02,'42'),('sv4pt5-43','Houndstone',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Psychic',972,'sv4pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/43.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/43_hires.png','A lovingly mourned Pokémon was reborn as Houndstone. It doesn\'t like anyone touching the protuberance atop its head.','Z miłością opłakiwany Pokémon odrodził się jako Houndstone. Nie lubi, gdy ktoś dotyka wypustki na czubku jego głowy.','Darkness',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-43',0.05,0.02,'43'),('sv4pt5-44','Gimmighoul',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Psychic',999,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/44.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/44_hires.png','This Pokémon was born inside a treasure chest about 1,500 years ago. It sucks the life-force out of scoundrels who try to steal the treasure.','Ten Pokémon narodził się w skrzyni ze skarbami około 1500 lat temu. Wysysa siły życiowe ze łobuzów, którzy próbują ukraść skarb.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-44',0.03,0.02,'44'),('sv4pt5-45','Mankey',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fighting',56,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/45.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/45_hires.png','It is extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant.','Jest niezwykle szybki w gniewie. W jednej chwili może być potulny, a w drugiej rzucać się.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-45',0.02,0.02,'45'),('sv4pt5-46','Primeape',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Fighting',57,'sv4pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/46.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/46_hires.png','Some researchers theorize that Primeape remains angry even when inside a Poké Ball.','Niektórzy badacze wysuwają teorię, że Primeape pozostaje wściekły nawet będąc w Poké Ballu.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-46',0.02,0.02,'46'),('sv4pt5-47','Annihilape',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',140,'Fighting',979,'sv4pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/47.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/47_hires.png','It imbues its fists with the power of the rage that it kept hidden in its heart. Opponents struck by these imbued fists will be shattered to their core.','Nasyca swoje pięści mocą gniewu, który skrywał w swoim sercu. Przeciwnicy uderzeni tymi nasyconymi pięściami zostaną roztrzaskani do szpiku kości.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-47',0.05,0.02,'47'),('sv4pt5-48','Phanpy',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Fighting',231,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/48.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/48_hires.png','This Pokémon lives and nests on a riverbank. After playing in the mud, it won\'t be able to settle down unless it washes its