źny wygląd, gdy chroni swoją rodzinę.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-63',0.05,0.02,'63'),('sv4pt5-64','Varoom',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Metal',965,'sv4pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/64.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/64_hires.png','It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.','Mówi się, że ten Pokémon narodził się, gdy nieznany trujący Pokémon wszedł do silnika pozostawionego w fabryce złomu i go ożywił.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-64',0.02,0.02,'64'),('sv4pt5-65','Revavroom',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Metal',966,'sv4pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/65.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/65_hires.png','It creates a gas out of poison and minerals from rocks. It then detonates the gas in its cylinders— now numbering eight—to generate energy.','Tworzy gaz z trucizny i minerałów ze skał. Następnie detonuje gaz w swoich cylindrach — teraz w liczbie ośmiu — aby wytworzyć energię.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-65',0.06,0.02,'65'),('sv4pt5-66','Iron Treads ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,ex,Future','Basic',220,'Metal',990,'sv4pt5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/66.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/66_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fire',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv4pt5-66',0.43,0.02,'66'),('sv4pt5-67','Gholdengo',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Metal',1000,'sv4pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/67.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv4pt5/67_hires.png','Its body seems to be made up of 1,000 coins. This Pokémon gets along well with others and is quick to make friends with anybody.','Jego ciało wydaje się być zbudowane z 1000 monet. Ten Pokémon dobrze dogaduje się z innymi i szybko zaprzyjaźnia się z każdym.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https: