ędzie słuchać poleceń doświadczonego Trenera. Jego zachowanie wynika z życia w stadach w starożytności.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-106',0.03,0.02,'106'),('sv5-107','Sableye',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Darkness',302,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/107.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/107_hires.png','It dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself.','Mieszka w ciemnościach jaskiń. Używa ostrych pazurów, aby wykopywać klejnoty i się nimi odżywiać.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-107',0.03,0.02,'107'),('sv5-108','Farigiraf ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,Tera,ex','Stage 1',260,'Darkness',981,'sv5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/108.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/108_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-108',0.98,0.29,'108'),('sv5-109','Roaring Moon',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Ancient','Basic',140,'Darkness',1005,'sv5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/109.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/109_hires.png','It is possible that this is the creature listed as Roaring Moon in an expedition journal that still holds many mysteries.','Możliwe, że to jest stworzenie wymienione jako Roaring Moon w dzienniku wyprawy, który wciąż kryje wiele tajemnic.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-109',0.11,0.02,'109'),('sv5-11','Grotle',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Grass',388,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/11.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/11_hires.png','It lives along water in forests. In the daytime, it leaves the forest to sunbathe its treed shell.','Żyje wzdłuż wody w lasach. W dzień opuszcza las, aby wygrzewać się na słońcu w swojej drzewiastej skorupie.','Fire',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-11',0.04,0.02,'11'),('sv5-110','Forretress',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',13