kémon have occurred in recent years. It resembles a mysterious object described in an old expedition journal.','W ostatnich latach pojawiły się doniesienia o tym Pokémonie. Przypomina tajemniczy obiekt opisany w starym dzienniku wyprawy.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-118',0.03,0.02,'118'),('sv5-119','Koraidon',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Ancient','Basic',140,'Dragon',1007,'sv5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/119.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/119_hires.png','This seems to be the Winged King mentioned in an old expedition journal. It was said to have split the land with its bare fists.','Wygląda na to, że to Skrzydlaty Król, o którym mowa w starym dzienniku wyprawy. Mówiono, że podzielił ziemię gołymi pięściami.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-119',0.23,0.02,'119'),('sv5-12','Torterra ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,ex','Stage 2',340,'Grass',389,'sv5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/12.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/12_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fire',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-12',0.78,0.1,'12'),('sv5-120','Koraidon ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,ex,Ancient','Basic',230,'Dragon',1007,'sv5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/120.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/120_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-120',0.63,0.11,'120'),('sv5-121','Miraidon',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Future','Basic',110,'Dragon',1008,'sv5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/121.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/121_hires.png','This seems to be the Iron Serpent mentioned in an old book. The Iron Serpent is said to have turned the land to ash with its lightning.','To zdaje się być Żelazny Wąż wspomniany w starej księdze. Mówi się, że Żelazny Wąż zamienił ziemię w popiół za pomocą pioruna.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-121',1.94,1,'121'),('sv5-122','Miraidon ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,ex,Future','Basic',220,'Dragon',1008,'sv5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/122.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/122_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-122',0.69,0.1,'122'),('sv5-123','Raging Bolt ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,ex,Ancient','Basic',240,'Dragon',NULL,'sv5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/123.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/123_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-123',4.08,1.49,'123'),('sv5-124','Lickitung',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',100,'Colorless',108,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/124.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/124_hires.png','If this Pokémon\'s sticky saliva gets on you and you don\'t clean it off, an intense itch will set in. The itch won\'t go away, either.','Jeśli lepka ślina tego Pokémona dostanie się na ciebie i nie wyczyścisz jej, pojawi się intensywne swędzenie. Swędzenie również nie ustąpi.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-124',0.03,0.02,'124'),('sv5-125','Lickilicky',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',150,'Colorless',463,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/125.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/125_hires.png','Lickilicky\'s strange tongue can stretch to many times the length of its body. No one has figured out how Lickilicky\'s tongue can stretch so far.','Dziwny język Lickilicky’ego może rozciągać się na wiele długości jego ciała. Nikt nie odkrył, jak język Lickilicky’ego może rozciągać się tak daleko.','Fighting',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-125',0.04,0.02,'125'),('sv5-126','Hoothoot',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Colorless',163,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/126.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/126_hires.png','It always stands on one foot. It changes feet so fast, the movement can rarely be seen.','Zawsze stoi na jednej nodze. Zmienia nogi tak szybko, że ruch ten rzadko można zobaczyć.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-126',0.04,0.02,'126'),('sv5-127','Noctowl',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Colorless',164,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/127.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/127_hires.png','Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.','Jego oczy są specjalnie rozwinięte, aby umożliwić mu wyraźne widzenie nawet w całkowitej ciemności i przy minimalnym oświetleniu.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-127',0.05,0.02,'127'),('sv5-128','Dunsparce',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Colorless',206,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/128.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/128_hires.png','It creates mazes in dark locations. When spotted, it flees into the ground by digging with its tail.','Tworzy labirynty w ciemnych miejscach. Gdy zostanie zauważony, ucieka w ziemię, kopiąc ogonem.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-128',0.04,0.02,'128'),('sv5-129','Dudunsparce',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Colorless',982,'sv5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/129.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/129_hires.png','This Pokémon uses its hard tail to make its nest by boring holes into bedrock deep underground. The nest can reach lengths of over six miles.','Ten Pokémon używa swojego twardego ogona, aby zbudować gniazdo, wiercąc dziury w podłożu skalnym głęboko pod ziemią. Gniazdo może osiągnąć długość ponad sześciu mil.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-129',0.19,0.02,'129'),('sv5-13','Shaymin',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Grass',492,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/13.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/13_hires.png','It can dissolve toxins in the air to instantly transform ruined land into a lush field of flowers.','Potrafi rozpuścić toksyny w powietrz