emontcg.io/sv5/55_hires.png','While its durable shell protects it from attacks, Charjabug strikes at enemies with jolts of electricity discharged from the tips of its jaws.','Choć wytrzymała skorupa chroni go przed atakami, Charjabug atakuje wrogów impulsami elektrycznymi, które wydobywają się z czubków jego szczęk.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-55',0.04,0.02,'55'),('sv5-56','Vikavolt',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Lightning',738,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/56.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/56_hires.png','It builds up electricity in its abdomen, focuses it through its jaws, and then fires the electricity off in concentrated beams.','Gromadzi energię elektryczną w odwłoku, skupia ją w szczękach, a następnie wystrzeliwuje ją w skoncentrowanych wiązkach.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-56',0.03,0.02,'56'),('sv5-57','Zeraora',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Lightning',807,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/57.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/57_hires.png','It runs as fast as lightning strikes, shredding its opponents with its high-voltage claws.','Pędzi tak szybko, jak uderzenia piorunów, rozszarpując przeciwników swoimi pazurami o wysokim napięciu.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-57',0.03,0.02,'57'),('sv5-58','Yamper',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',835,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/58.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/58_hires.png','This Pokémon is very popular as a herding dog in the Galar region. As it runs, it generates electricity from the base of its tail.','Ten Pokémon jest bardzo popularny jako pies pasterski w regionie Galar. Podczas biegu generuje elektryczność u nasady ogona.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-58',0.03,0.02,'58'),('sv5-59','Boltund',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Lightning',836,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/59.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/59_hires.png','This Pokémon generates electricity and channels it into its legs to keep them going strong. Boltund can run nonstop for three full days.','Ten Pokémon generuje prąd i kieruje go do swoich nóg, aby były silne. Boltund może biec bez przerwy przez trzy pełne dni.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-59',0.04,0.02,'59'),('sv5-6','Shroomish',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Grass',285,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/6.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/6_hires.png','If it senses danger, it scatters spores from the top of its head to protect itself.','Jeśli wyczuje niebezpieczeństwo, rozrzuca zarodniki z czubka głowy, aby się chronić.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-6',0.03,0.02,'6'),('sv5-60','Wugtrio ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,Tera,ex','Stage 1',250,'Lightning',961,'sv5','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/60_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-60',0.63,0.08,'60'),('sv5-61','Iron Hands',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Future','Basic',140,'Lightning',992,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/61_hires.png','This Pokémon shares many similarities with Iron Hands, an object mentioned in a certain expedition journal.','Ten Pokémon ma wiele podobieństw do Iron Hands, obiektu wspomnianego w dzienniku pewnej wyprawy.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-61',0.03,0.02,'61'),('sv5-62','Iron Thorns',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Future','Basic',140,'Lightning',995,'sv5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/62.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/62_hires.png','Some of its notable features match those of an object named within a certain expedition journal as Iron Thorns.','Niektóre z jego istotnych cech pokrywają się 