mona od tyłu.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-66',0.03,0.02,'66'),('sv5-67','Latias',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Psychic',380,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/67.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/67_hires.png','It communicates using telepathy. Its body is covered in down that refracts light to make it invisible.','Komunikuje się za pomocą telepatii. Jego ciało pokryte jest puchem, który załamuje światło, czyniąc go niewidzialnym.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-67',0.04,0.02,'67'),('sv5-68','Bronzor',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Psychic',436,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/68.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/68_hires.png','Ancient people believed that the pattern on Bronzor\'s back contained a mysterious power.','Starożytni ludzie wierzyli, że wzór na plecach Bronzora ma tajemniczą moc.','Darkness',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-68',0.02,0.02,'68'),('sv5-69','Bronzong',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Psychic',437,'sv5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/69.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/69_hires.png','In ages past, this Pokémon was revered as a bringer of rain. It was found buried in the ground.','Dawniej ten Pokémon był czczony jako zwiastun deszczu. Znaleziono go zakopanego w ziemi.','Darkness',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-69',0.03,0.02,'69'),('sv5-7','Breloom',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Grass',286,'sv5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/7.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/7_hires.png','The seeds on its tail are made of toxic spores. It knocks out foes with quick, virtually invisible punches.','Nasiona na jego ogonie są zrobione z toksycznych zarodników. Powala wrogów szybkimi, praktycznie niewidocznymi ciosami.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv5-7',0.03,0.02,'7'),('sv5-70','Solosis',NULL,'Pokémon'