range physiology that responds to electricity. When together with Karrablast, Shelmet evolves for some reason.','Ma dziwną fizjologię, która reaguje na elektryczność. Kiedy jest razem z Karrablastem, Shelmet ewoluuje z jakiegoś powodu.','Fire',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-12',0.02,0.02,'12'),('sv9-120','Dunsparce',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Colorless',206,'sv9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/120.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/120_hires.png','It creates mazes in dark locations. When spotted, it flees into the ground by digging with its tail.','Tworzy labirynty w ciemnych miejscach. Gdy zostanie zauważony, ucieka w ziemię, kopiąc ogonem.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-120',0.05,0.02,'120'),('sv9-121','Dudunsparce ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,ex','Stage 1',270,'Colorless',982,'sv9','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/121.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/121_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-121',0.75,0.02,'121'),('sv9-122','Kecleon',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Colorless',352,'sv9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/122.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/122_hires.png','It changes its hue to blend into its surroundings. If no one takes notice of it for too long, it will pout and never reveal itself.','Zmienia swój odcień, by wtopić się w otoczenie. Jeśli nikt nie zwróci na niego uwagi przez zbyt długi czas, będzie się dąsał i nigdy się nie ujawni.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-122',0.04,0.02,'122'),('sv9-123','Tropius',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Colorless',357,'sv9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/123.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/123_hires.png','Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit.','Pyszne owoce wyrastały mu z szyi, bo zawsze jadł ten sam rodzaj owoców.','Lightning