ong, it can change the landscape. It is so insolent that it doesn\'t care about others.','Niezwykle silny, może zmienić krajobraz. Jest tak bezczelny, że nie obchodzi go los innych.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-95',0.08,0.02,'95'),('sv9-96','N\'s Purrloin',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Darkness',509,'sv9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/96.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/96_hires.png','Opponents that get drawn in by its adorable behavior come away with stinging scratches from its claws and stinging pride from its laughter.','Przeciwnicy, których wciągnie jego urocze zachowanie, odchodzą z bolesnymi zadrapaniami od jego pazurów i bolesną dumą od jego śmiechu.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-96',0.04,0.02,'96'),('sv9-97','N\'s Zorua',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Darkness',570,'sv9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/97.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/97_hires.png','It changes into the forms of others to surprise them. Apparently, it often transforms into a silent child.','Zmienia się w kształty innych, aby ich zaskoczyć. Najwyraźniej często przeobraża się w ciche dziecko.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-97',0.07,0.02,'97'),('sv9-98','N\'s Zoroark ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,ex','Stage 1',280,'Darkness',571,'sv9','Double Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/98.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/98_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/sv9-98',3.28,1.5,'98'),('sv9-99','Pangoro',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Darkness',675,'sv9','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/99.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv9/99_hires.png','Using its leaf, Pangoro can predict the moves of its opponents. It strikes with punches that can turn a dump truck into scrap with just one hit.','Dzięki liściom Pangoro może przewidywać ruchy przeciwników. Uderza ciosami, które mogą zamieni