s, helping it spot both attackers and prey right away.','Potrafi widzieć we wszystkich kierunkach bez poruszania dużymi oczami, co pomaga mu natychmiast dostrzec zarówno napastników, jak i ofiarę.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-185',1.88,1,'185'),('svp-186','Scraggy',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Darkness',559,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/186.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/186_hires.png','If it locks eyes with you, watch out! Nothing and no one is safe from the reckless headbutts of this troublesome Pokémon.','Jeśli spojrzy ci w oczy, uważaj! Nic i nikt nie jest bezpieczny przed lekkomyślnymi uderzeniami głową tego kłopotliwego Pokémona.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-186',2.16,1.5,'186'),('svp-187','Yanmega',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Grass',469,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/187.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/187_hires.png','Its jaw power is incredible. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed.','Jego szczęka ma niesamowitą siłę. Potrafi rozgryźć wrogów, lecąc z dużą prędkością.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-187',0.21,0.02,'187'),('svp-188','Scrafty',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Darkness',560,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/188.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/188_hires.png','As halfhearted as this Pokémon\'s kicks may seem, they pack enough power to shatter Conkeldurr\'s concrete pillars.','Choć kopniaki tego Pokémona mogą wydawać się nieśmiałe, mają w sobie wystarczająco dużo mocy, by rozbić betonowe filary Conkeldurra.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-188',0.24,0.02,'188'),('svp-189','N\'s Zorua',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Darkness',570,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/189.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/189_hires.png','It changes into the forms of others to surprise them. Apparently, it often transforms into a silent child.','Zmienia się w kształty innych, aby ich zaskoczyć. Najwyraźniej często przeobraża się w ciche dziecko.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-189',4.14,2.5,'189'),('svp-19','Baxcalibur',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Water',998,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/19.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/19_hires.png','This Pokémon blasts cryogenic air out from its mouth. This air can instantly freeze even liquid-hot lava.','Ten Pokémon wydmuchuje kriogeniczne powietrze z pyska. To powietrze może natychmiast zamrozić nawet gorącą jak ciecz lawę.','Metal',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-19',2.8,0.99,'19'),('svp-193','Hop\'s Zacian ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,ex','Basic',230,'Metal',888,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/193.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/193_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-193',1.18,0.09,'193'),('svp-194','Iono\'s Bellibolt ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,ex','Stage 1',280,'Lightning',939,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/194.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/194_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-194',4.83,1.8,'194'),('svp-195','Lillie\'s Clefairy ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,ex','Basic',190,'Psychic',35,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/195.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/195_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-195',16.96,10,'195'),('svp-196','Charizard ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,Tera,ex','Stage 2',330,'Darkness',6,'svp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/196.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/svp/196_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/svp-196',10.34,3,'196'),('svp-197','Koraidon ex',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,ex','Basic',230,'Fighting',1007,'svp','Promo','http