ps://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh1/97_hires.png','Strong, but not too bright, this Pokémon can shatter even a skyscraper with its charging tackles.','Silny, ale niezbyt bystry, ten Pokémon potrafi zniszczyć nawet wieżowiec swoimi szarżami.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh1-97',0.05,0.02,'97'),('swsh1-98','Rhydon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Fighting',112,'swsh1','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh1/98.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh1/98_hires.png','Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.','Osłonięty przypominającą pancerz skórą, jest w stanie żyć w roztopionej lawie o temperaturze 3600 stopni Fahrenheita.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh1-98',0.06,0.02,'98'),('swsh1-99','Rhyperior',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',190,'Fighting',464,'swsh1','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh1/99.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh1/99_hires.png','It relies on its carapace to deflect incoming attacks and throw its enemy off balance. As soon as that happens, it drives its drill into the foe.','Polega na swoim pancerzu, aby odbijać nadchodzące ataki i wytrącać przeciwnika z równowagi. Gdy tylko to nastąpi, wbija wiertło w przeciwnika.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh1-99',0.56,0.15,'99'),('swsh10-1','Beedrill V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',210,'Grass',15,'swsh10','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/1.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/1_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh10-1',0.94,0.3,'1'),('swsh10-10','Kricketune',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Grass',402,'swsh10','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/10.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/10_hires.png','It uses its cutlass-like arms to produce sound, the melody of which varies from individual to individual. It is a worthwhile end