,'Fire',485,'swsh10','Radiant Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/27.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/27_hires.png','Boiling blood, like magma, circulates through its body. It makes its dwelling place in volcanic caves.','Wrząca krew, niczym magma, krąży w jego ciele. Zamieszkuje w jaskiniach wulkanicznych.','Water',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh10-27',0.5,0.04,'27'),('swsh10-28','Psyduck',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',54,'swsh10','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/28.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/28_hires.png','Suffers perpetual headaches. If the agony grows too great, Psyduck\'s latent power erupts, contrary to Psyduck\'s intent. Ergo, I am exploring ways to ease the pain.','Cierpi na ciągłe bóle głowy. Jeśli cierpienie staje się zbyt wielkie, ukryta moc Psyducka wybucha wbrew jego intencjom. Dlatego też szukam sposobów na złagodzenie bólu.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh10-28',0.05,0.02,'28'),('swsh10-29','Golduck',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Water',55,'swsh10','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/29.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/29_hires.png','This Pokémon lives in gently flowing rivers. It paddles through the water with its long limbs, putting its graceful swimming skills on display.','Ten Pokémon żyje w łagodnie płynących rzekach. Przepływa przez wodę długimi kończynami, prezentując swoje wdzięczne umiejętności pływackie.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh10-29',0.04,0.02,'29'),('swsh10-3','Hisuian Electrode',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Grass',101,'swsh10','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/3.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh10/3_hires.png','The tissue on the surface of its body is curiously similar in composition to an Apricorn. When irritated, this Pokémon lets loose an electric current equal to 20 lightning bolts.','Tkanka na powierzchni jego 