 Pokémon takes lost children by the hand to guide them to the spirit world.','Płomień na jego głowie utrzymuje jego ciało w lekkim cieple. Ten Pokémon bierze zagubione dzieci za rękę, aby poprowadzić je do świata duchów.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-24',0.03,0.02,'24'),('swsh11-25','Lampent',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Fire',608,'swsh11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/25.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/25_hires.png','This Pokémon appears just before someone passes away, so it\'s feared as an emissary of death.','Ten Pokémon pojawia się tuż przed czyjąś śmiercią, dlatego obawia się go jako posłańca śmierci.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-25',0.03,0.02,'25'),('swsh11-26','Chandelure',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',150,'Fire',609,'swsh11','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/26.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/26_hires.png','This Pokémon haunts dilapidated mansions. It sways its arms to hypnotize opponents with the ominous dancing of its flames.','Ten Pokémon nawiedza podupadłe rezydencje. Macha ramionami, by hipnotyzować przeciwników złowieszczym tańcem płomieni.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-26',0.19,0.02,'26'),('swsh11-27','Delphox V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',210,'Fire',655,'swsh11','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/27.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/27_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-27',0.67,0.15,'27'),('swsh11-28','Litleo',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fire',667,'swsh11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/28.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/28_hires.png','This hot-blooded Pokémon is filled with curiosity. When it gets angry or starts fighting, its short mane gets hot.','Ten gorącokrwisty Pokémon jest pełen ciekawości. Kiedy się wścieka lub zaczyna walczyć, jego krótka grz