whirl\'s has been used in place of lullabies to get children to go to sleep.','Patrzenie na wir na brzuchu powoduje senność. Ta cecha Poliwhirla była używana zamiast kołysanek, aby dzieci zasnęły.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-31',0.04,0.02,'31'),('swsh11-32','Politoed',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',140,'Water',186,'swsh11','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/32.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/32_hires.png','At nightfall, these Pokémon appear on the shores of lakes. They announce their territorial claims by letting out cries that sound like shouting.','Nocą te Pokémony pojawiają się na brzegach jezior. Ogłaszają swoje roszczenia terytorialne, wydając odgłosy przypominające krzyki.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-32',0.12,0.02,'32'),('swsh11-33','Seel',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',86,'swsh11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/33.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/33_hires.png','Thanks to its thick fat, cold seas don\'t bother it at all, but it gets tired pretty easily in warm waters.','Dzięki gęstej tkance tłuszczowej zimne morza wcale mu nie przeszkadzają, ale w ciepłych wodach męczy się dość łatwo.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-33',0.02,0.02,'33'),('swsh11-34','Dewgong',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Water',87,'swsh11','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/34.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/34_hires.png','It sunbathes on the beach after meals. The rise in its body temperature helps its digestion.','Opala się na plaży po posiłkach. Wzrost temperatury ciała pomaga w trawieniu.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh11-34',0.09,0.02,'34'),('swsh11-35','Horsea',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',50,'Water',116,'swsh11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/35.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh11/35_hires.png','Horsea makes its