lutters through the air, it crackles with electricity. This Pokémon is cute, but it can cause a lot of trouble.','Gdy Emolga fruwa w powietrzu, trzeszczy od elektryczności. Ten Pokémon jest słodki, ale może sprawić wiele kłopotów.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-54',0.03,0.02,'54'),('swsh12-55','Stunfisk',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Lightning',618,'swsh12','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/55.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/55_hires.png','Thanks to bacteria that lived in the mud flats with it, this Pokémon developed the organs it uses to generate electricity.','Dzięki bakteriom, które żyły z nim na bagnach, ten Pokémon rozwinął organy, których używa do wytwarzania elektryczności.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-55',0.03,0.02,'55'),('swsh12-56','Zeraora',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Lightning',807,'swsh12','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/56.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/56_hires.png','It approaches its enemies at the speed of lightning, then tears them limb from limb with its sharp claws.','Zbliża się do wrogów z prędkością światła, a następnie rozrywa ich na strzępy swoimi ostrymi pazurami.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-56',0.07,0.02,'56'),('swsh12-57','Regieleki V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',200,'Lightning',894,'swsh12','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/57.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/57_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-57',0.61,0.09,'57'),('swsh12-58','Regieleki VMAX',NULL,'Pokémon','VMAX','VMAX',310,'Lightning',894,'swsh12','Rare Holo VMAX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/58.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/58_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-58',0.96,0.33,'58'),('swsh12-59','Radiant Alakazam',NULL,'Pokémon','