nia lub elektryczności.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-85',0.04,0.02,'85'),('swsh12-86','Indeedee',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Psychic',876,'swsh12','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/86.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/86_hires.png','These intelligent Pokémon touch horns with each other to share information between them.','Te inteligentne Pokémony dotykają się rogami, aby wymieniać się informacjami.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-86',0.03,0.02,'86'),('swsh12-87','Dreepy',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Psychic',885,'swsh12','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/87.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/87_hires.png','After being reborn as a ghost Pokémon, Dreepy wanders the areas it used to inhabit back when it was alive in prehistoric seas.','Po odrodzeniu się jako Pokémon-duch, Dreepy wędruje po obszarach, które zamieszkiwał, gdy żył w prehistorycznych morzach.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-87',0.04,0.02,'87'),('swsh12-88','Drakloak',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',886,'swsh12','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/88.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/88_hires.png','It\'s capable of flying faster than 120 mph. It battles alongside Dreepy and dotes on them until they successfully evolve.','Potrafi latać szybciej niż 120 mph. Walczy u boku Dreepy\'ego i rozpieszcza ich, dopóki nie uda im się ewoluować.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12-88',0.04,0.02,'88'),('swsh12-89','Dragapult',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',150,'Psychic',887,'swsh12','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/89.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/89_hires.png','When it isn\'t battling, it keeps Dreepy in the holes on its horns. Once a fight starts, it launches the Dreepy like supersonic missiles.','Kiedy nie walczy, trzyma Dreepy\'ego w dziurach na 