n it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound.','W tropikach jest go pod dostatkiem. Kiedy tańczy, jego płatki ocierają się o siebie i wydają przyjemny, dzwoniący dźwięk.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-3',0.09,0.02,'3'),('swsh12pt5-30','Galarian Mr. Mime',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Water',122,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/30.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/30_hires.png','It can radiate chilliness from the bottoms of its feet. It\'ll spend the whole day tap-dancing on a frozen floor.','Może emanować chłodem spodem stóp. Spędzi cały dzień stepując na zamarzniętej podłodze.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-30',0.02,0.02,'30'),('swsh12pt5-31','Wailmer',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Water',320,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/31.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/31_hires.png','It shows off by spraying jets of seawater from the nostrils above its eyes. It eats a solid ton of Wishiwashi every day.','Pokazuje się, tryskając strumieniami wody morskiej z nozdrzy nad oczami. Codziennie zjada solidną tonę Wishiwashi.','Lightning',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-31',0.03,0.02,'31'),('swsh12pt5-32','Wailord',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',220,'Water',321,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/32.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/32_hires.png','It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.','Czasami może powalić przeciwników wstrząsem powstałym w wyniku przebicia się i rozbicia jego wielkiego ciała o wodę.','Lightning',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-32',0.1,0.02,'32'),('swsh12pt5-33','Corphish',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',341,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/33.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/33_hires.png','No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive.','Bez względu na to, jak brudna jest woda w rzece, dostosuje się i będzie się rozwijać. Ma silną wolę przetrwania.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-33',0.02,0.02,'33'),('swsh12pt5-34','Snorunt',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',361,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/34.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/34_hires.png','It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as -150 degrees Fahrenheit.','Może przetrwać tylko w zimnych rejonach. Skacze radośnie, nawet w środowiskach tak zimnych jak -150 stopni Fahrenheita.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-34',0.02,0.02,'34'),('swsh12pt5-35','Luvdisc',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',370,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/35.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/35_hires.png','Luvdisc makes its home in coral reefs in warm seas. It especially likes sleeping in the space between Corsola\'s branches.','Luvdisc mieszka w rafach koralowych w ciepłych morzach. Szczególnie lubi spać w przestrzeni między gałęziami Corsoli.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-35',0.02,0.02,'35'),('swsh12pt5-36','Kyogre',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',140,'Water',382,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/36.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/36_hires.png','It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.','Mówi się, że poszerzył morza, powodując ulewy. Spał w rowie morskim.','Lightning',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-36',0.46,0.02,'36'),('swsh12pt5-37','Kyogre V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',230,'Water',382,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo V','https://image