nie jest oznaką, że Shinx generuje ogromną ilość elektryczności.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-40',0.03,0.02,'40'),('swsh12pt5-41','Luxio',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,Rapid Strike','Stage 1',80,'Lightning',404,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/41.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/41_hires.png','Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.','Silny prąd przepływa przez końcówki jego ostrych pazurów. Lekkie zadrapanie powoduje omdlenie u wrogów.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-41',0.04,0.02,'41'),('swsh12pt5-42','Luxio',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Lightning',404,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/42.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/42_hires.png','By joining its tail with that of another Luxio, this Pokémon can receive some of the other Luxio\'s electricity and power up its own electric blasts.','Łącząc swój ogon z ogonem innego Luxio, ten Pokémon może otrzymywać część energii elektrycznej innego Luxio i zasilać własne wyładowania elektryczne.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-42',0.03,0.02,'42'),('swsh12pt5-43','Luxray',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,Rapid Strike','Stage 2',150,'Lightning',405,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/43.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/43_hires.png','Luxray\'s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it\'s scouting for danger.','Umiejętność Luxraya widzenia przez przedmioty przydaje się, gdy wypatruje niebezpieczeństwa.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-43',0.1,0.02,'43'),('swsh12pt5-44','Luxray',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Lightning',405,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/44.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/44_hires.png','Luxray can see through solid objects. It will instantly spot prey trying to hide behind walls, even if the walls are thick.','Luxray widzi przez obiekty stałe. Natychmiast wykryje ofiarę próbującą ukryć się za ścianami, nawet jeśli ściany są grube.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-44',0.11,0.02,'44'),('swsh12pt5-45','Rotom V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',190,'Lightning',479,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/45.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/45_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-45',0.98,0.2,'45'),('swsh12pt5-46','Rotom VSTAR',NULL,'Pokémon','VSTAR','VSTAR',250,'Lightning',479,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo VSTAR','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/46.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/46_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-46',1.32,0.49,'46'),('swsh12pt5-47','Emolga',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',587,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/47.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/47_hires.png','As it flies, it scatters electricity around, so bird Pokémon keep their distance. That\'s why Emolga can keep all its food to itself.','Podczas lotu rozrzuca wokół elektryczność, więc Pokémony-ptaki trzymają się z daleka. Dlatego Emolga może zatrzymać całe swoje jedzenie dla siebie.','Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-47',0.03,0.02,'47'),('swsh12pt5-48','Eelektrik',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Lightning',603,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/48.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/48_hires.png','These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.','Te Pokémony mają wielki apetyt. Kiedy dostrzegą swoją ofiarę, atakują ją i paraliżują elektrycznością.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-48',0.02,0.02,'48'),('swsh12pt5-49','Helioptile',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',694,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/49.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/49_hires.png','When spread, the frills on its head act like solar panels, generating the power behind this Pokémon\'s electric moves.','Po rozłożeniu falbanki na głowie działają jak panele słoneczne, generując energię napędzającą elektryczne ruchy tego Pokémona.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-49',0.02,0.02,'49'),('swsh12pt5-5','Tangrowth',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',150,'Grass',465,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/5.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/5_hires.png','Tangrowth has two arms that it can extend as it pleases. Recent research has shown that these arms are, in fact, bundles of vines.','Tangrowth ma dwa ramiona, które może rozciągać, jak mu się podoba. Ostatnie badania wykazały, że ramiona te są w rzeczywistości wiązkami winorośli.','Fire',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-5',0.09,0.02,'5'),('swsh12pt5-50','Heliolisk',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Lightning',695,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/50.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/50_hires.png','A now-vanished desert culture treasured these Pokémon. Appropriately, when Heliolisk came to the Galar region, treasure came with them.','Zaginiona kultura pustynna ceniła te Pokémony. Odpowiednio, gdy Heliolisk przybył do regionu Galar, skarb przybył wraz z nimi.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-50',0.11,0.02,'50'),('swsh12pt5-51','Radiant Charjabug',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Radiant','Basic',90,'Lightning',737,'swsh12pt5','Radiant Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/51.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/51_hires.png','While its durable shell protects it from attacks, Charjabug strikes at enemies with jolts of electricity discharged from the tips of its jaws.','Choć wytrzymała skorupa chroni go przed atakami, Charjabug atakuje wrogów impulsami elektrycznymi, które wydobywają się z czubków jego szczęk.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-51',0.37,0.02,'51'),('swsh12pt5-52','Zeraora',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Lightning',807,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/52.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/52_hires.png','It approaches its enemies at the speed of lightning, then tears them limb from limb with its sharp claws.','Zbliża się do wrogów z prędkością światła, a następnie rozrywa ich na strzępy swoimi ostrymi pazurami.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-52',0.08,0.02,'52'),('swsh12pt5-53','Zeraora V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',210,'Lightning',807,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/53.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/53_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-53',0.88,0.2,'53'),('swsh12pt5-54','Zeraora VMAX',NULL,'Pokémon','VMAX','VMAX',320,'Lightning',807,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo VMAX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/54.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/54_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-54',2.17,1.25,'54'),('swsh12pt5-55','Zeraora VSTAR',NULL,'Pokémon','VSTAR','VSTAR',270,'Lightning',807,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo VSTAR','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/55.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/55_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-55',2.04,0.8,'55'),('swsh12pt5-56','Pincurchin',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Lightning',871,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/56.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/56_hires.png','It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.','Żywi się wodorostami, używając zębów do zdrapywania ich ze skał. Prąd elektryczny płynie z końcówek jego kolców.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-56',0.03,0.02,'56'),('swsh12pt5-57','Exeggcute',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Psychic',102,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/57.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/57_hires.png','Though it may look like it\'s just a bunch of eggs, it\'s a proper Pokémon. Exeggcute communicates with others of its kind via telepathy, apparently.','Choć może wyglądać jak po prostu sterta jajek, to jest to prawdziwy Pokémon. Exeggcute komunikuje się z innymi Pokémonami swojego gatunku za pomocą telepatii, jak widać.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-57',0.02,0.02,'57'),('swsh12pt5-58','Exeggutor',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Psychic',103,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/58.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/58_hires.png','Each of Exeggutor\'s three heads is thinking different thoughts. The three don\'t seem to be very interested in one another.','Każda z trzech głów Exeggutora myśli inaczej. Te trzy nie wydają się być sobą specjalnie zainteresowane.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-58',0.09,0.02,'58'),('swsh12pt5-59','Mewtwo',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',130,'Psychic',150,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/59.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/59_hires.png','A Pokémon created by recombining Mew\'s genes. It\'s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.','Pokemon stworzony przez rekombinację genów Mew. Mówi się, że ma najbardziej dzikie serce wśród Pokémonów.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-59',1.02,0.15,'59'),('swsh12pt5-6','Scyther',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Grass',123,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/6.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/6_hires.png','As Scyther fights more and more battles, its scythes become sharper and sharper. With a single slice, Scyther can fell a massive tree.','W miarę jak Scyther toczy coraz więcej bitew, jego kosy stają się coraz ostrzejsze. Jednym cięciem Scyther może ściąć ogromne drzewo.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-6',0.03,0.02,'6'),('swsh12pt5-60','Mew V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V,Fusion Strike','Basic',180,'Psychic',151,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/60_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-60',1.9,0.5,'60'),('swsh12pt5-61','Girafarig',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Psychic',203,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/61_hires.png','Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting.','Jego ogon ma własny mały mózg. Uważaj! Jeśli się zbliżysz, może zareagować na twój zapach gryzieniem.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-61',0.02,0.02,'61'),('swsh12pt5-62','Lunatone',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Psychic',337,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/62.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/62_hires.png','The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It\'s active on the night of a full moon.','Faza księżyca najwyraźniej ma pewien wpływ na jego moc. Jest aktywny w noc pełni księżyca.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-62',0.03,0.02,'62'),('swsh12pt5-63','Dusclops',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',356,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/63.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/63_hires.png','Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.','Jego ciało jest całkowicie puste. Kiedy otwiera usta, wsysa wszystko, jakby było czarną dziurą.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-63',0.03,0.02,'63'),('swsh12pt5-64','Tapu Lele',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Psychic',786,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/64.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/64_hires.png','Although called a guardian deity, Tapu Lele is devoid of guilt about its cruel disposition and can be described as nature incarnate.','Choć Tapu Lele jest nazywany bóstwem opiekuńczym, nie odczuwa poczucia winy z powodu swego okrutnego usposobienia i można go opisać jako ucieleśnienie natury.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-64',0.3,0.02,'64'),('swsh12pt5-65','Hatterene V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',200,'Psychic',858,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/65.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/65_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-65',0.7,0.2,'65'),('swsh12pt5-66','Hatterene VMAX',NULL,'Pokémon','VMAX','VMAX',320,'Psychic',858,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo VMAX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/66.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/66_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-66',1.47,0.7,'66'),('swsh12pt5-67','Enamorus',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Psychic',905,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/67.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/67_hires.png','When it flies to this land from across the sea, the bitter winter comes to an end. According to legend, this Pokémon\'s love gives rise to the budding of fresh life across Hisui.','Kiedy przylatuje do tej krainy zza morza, mroźna zima dobiega końca. Według legendy, miłość tego Pokémona daje początek pączkowaniu nowego życia w Hisui.','Metal',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-67',0.09,0.02,'67'),('swsh12pt5-68','Graveler',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Fighting',75,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/68.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/68_hires.png','It travels by rolling down cliffs. If it falls into a river, it will explode with its last gasp.','Podróżuje, staczając się po klifach. Jeśli wpadnie do rzeki, eksploduje ostatnim tchnieniem.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-68',0.03,0.02,'68'),('swsh12pt5-69','Solrock',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Fighting',338,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/69.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/69_hires.png','When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.','Kiedy się obraca, emituje światło podobne do słońca, oślepiając w ten sposób swoich wrogów.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-69',0.02,0.02,'69'),('swsh12pt5-7','Sunkern',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Grass',191,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/7.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/7_hires.png','It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else.','Żyje pijąc tylko krople rosy spod liści roślin. Mówi się, że nie je niczego innego.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-7',0.03,0.02,'7'),('swsh12pt5-70','Baltoy',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fighting',343,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/70.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/70_hires.png','It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.','Odkryto go w starożytnych ruinach. Podczas ruchu stale się obraca. Stoi na jednej nodze, nawet gdy śpi.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-70',0.02,0.02,'70'),('swsh12pt5-71','Riolu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fighting',447,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/71.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/71_hires.png','It\'s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience.','Jest niezwykle energiczny, z wystarczającą wytrzymałością, aby biegać przez całą noc. Zabieranie go na spacery może być trudnym doświadczeniem.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-71',0.03,0.02,'71'),('swsh12pt5-72','Pancham',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fighting',674,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/72.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/72_hires.png','It chooses a Pangoro as its master and then imitates its master\'s actions. This is how it learns to battle and hunt for prey.','Wybiera Pangoro na swojego pana, a następnie naśladuje działania swojego pana. W ten sposób uczy się walczyć i polować na zdobycz.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-72',0.03,0.02,'72'),('swsh12pt5-73','Rockruff',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fighting',744,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/73.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/73_hires.png','This Pokémon can bond very strongly with its Trainer, but it also has a habit of biting. Raising a Rockruff for a long time can be challenging.','Ten Pokémon potrafi bardzo mocno przywiązać się do swojego Trenera, ale ma też zwyczaj gryzienia. Wychowywanie Rockruffa przez długi czas może być wyzwaniem.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-73',0.03,0.02,'73'),('swsh12pt5-74','Lycanroc',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Fighting',745,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/74.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/74_hires.png','This form of Lycanroc is reckless. It charges headlong at its opponents, attacking without any care about what injuries it might receive.','Ta forma Lycanroca jest lekkomyślna. Rzuca się na przeciwników, atakując bez względu na to, jakie obrażenia może otrzymać.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-74',0.07,0.02,'74'),('swsh12pt5-75','Koffing',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Darkness',109,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/75.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/75_hires.png','It adores polluted air. Some claim that Koffing used to be more plentiful in the Galar region than they are now.','Uwielbia zanieczyszczone powietrze. Niektórzy twierdzą, że Koffing był kiedyś bardziej powszechny w regionie Galar niż teraz.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-75',0.02,0.02,'75'),('swsh12pt5-76','Absol',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',100,'Darkness',359,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/76.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/76_hires.png','Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters.','Szybki jak wiatr, Absol pędzi przez pola i góry. Jego zakrzywiony, łukowaty róg jest niezwykle wrażliwy na ostrzegawcze sygnały klęsk żywiołowych.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-76',0.34,0.02,'76'),('swsh12pt5-77','Purrloin',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Darkness',509,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/77.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/77_hires.png','It steals things from people just to amuse itself with their frustration. A rivalry exists between this Pokémon and Nickit.','Kradnie ludziom rzeczy tylko po to, żeby zabawić się ich frustracją. Istnieje rywalizacja między tym Pokémonem a Nickitem.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-77',0.03,0.02,'77'),('swsh12pt5-78','Liepard',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Darkness',510,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/78.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/78_hires.png','Don\'t be fooled by its gorgeous fur and elegant figure. This is a moody and vicious Pokémon.','Nie daj się zwieść jego wspaniałemu futru i eleganckiej sylwetce. To kapryśny i okrutny Pokémon.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-78',0.09,0.02,'78'),('swsh12pt5-79','Krokorok',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Darkness',552,'swsh12pt5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/79.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/79_hires.png','It buries some of its prey in the sand to use as emergency meals when its hunts are unsuccessful.','Zakopuje część swoich ofiar w piasku, aby wykorzystać je jako awaryjne pożywienie, gdy polowania nie przynoszą rezultatu.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-79',0.03,0.02,'79'),('swsh12pt5-8','Yanma',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Grass',193,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/8.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/8_hires.png','If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area.','Jeśli będzie trzepotać skrzydłami naprawdę szybko, może wytworzyć fale uderzeniowe, które rozbiją okna w okolicy.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-8',0.03,0.02,'8'),('swsh12pt5-80','Pangoro',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Darkness',675,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/80.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/80_hires.png','This Pokémon is quick to anger, and it has no problem using its prodigious strength to get its way. It lives for duels against Obstagoon.','Ten Pokémon szybko wpada w złość i nie ma problemu z wykorzystaniem swojej ogromnej siły, aby osiągnąć swój cel. Żyje dla pojedynków z Obstagoonem.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-80',0.07,0.02,'80'),('swsh12pt5-81','Skrelp',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Darkness',690,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/81.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/81_hires.png','It drifts in the ocean, blending in with floating seaweed. When other Pokémon come to feast on the seaweed, Skrelp feasts on them instead.','Dryfuje w oceanie, mieszając się z unoszącymi się wodorostami. Kiedy inne Pokémony przychodzą ucztować na wodorostach, Skrelp ucztuje zamiast nich.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-81',0.03,0.02,'81'),('swsh12pt5-82','Dragalge',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Darkness',691,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/82.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/82_hires.png','Dragalge uses a poisonous liquid capable of corroding metal to send tankers that enter its territory to the bottom of the sea.','Dragalge używa trującej cieczy, która może powodować korozję metalu, aby wysyłać tankowce, które wkraczają na jego terytorium, na dno morza.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-82',0.11,0.02,'82'),('swsh12pt5-83','Hoopa',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Darkness',720,'swsh12pt5','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/83.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/83_hires.png','It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place.','Gromadzi rzeczy, które lubi i przepuszcza je przez swoją pętlę, aby teleportować je do sekretnego miejsca.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-83',0.32,0.02,'83'),('swsh12pt5-84','Galarian Meowth',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Metal',52,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/84.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/84_hires.png','Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémon\'s body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.','Życie z dzikim, morskim ludem tak zahartowało ciało tego Pokémona, że ​​niektóre jego części zamieniły się w żelazo.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-84',0.03,0.02,'84'),('swsh12pt5-85','Galarian Perrserker',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Metal',863,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/85.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/85_hires.png','What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.','To, co wygląda jak żelazny hełm, jest w rzeczywistości utwardzonymi włosami. Ten Pokémon żyje dla dreszczyku emocji związanego z walką.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-85',0.07,0.02,'85'),('swsh12pt5-86','Scizor',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Metal',212,'swsh12pt5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/86.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/86_hires.png','Bulky pincers account for one third of Scizor\'s body weight. A single swing of one of these pincers will crush a boulder completely.','Ogromne szczypce stanowią jedną trzecią masy ciała Scizora. Pojedyncze uderzenie jedną z tych szczypiec całkowicie zmiażdży głaz.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-86',0.11,0.02,'86'),('swsh12pt5-87','Aron',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Metal',304,'swsh12pt5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/87.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12pt5/87_hires.png','It eats iron ore—and sometimes railroad tracks— to build up the steel armor that protects its body.','Żywi się rudą żelaza, a czasem torami kolejowymi, aby zbudować stalowy pancerz chroniący jego ciało.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh12pt5-87',0.03,0.02,'87'),('swsh12pt5-88','Lairon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 