ss',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh2-105',0.05,0.02,'105'),('swsh2-106','Carkol',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Fighting',838,'swsh2','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/106.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/106_hires.png','It forms coal inside its body. Coal dropped by this Pokémon once helped fuel the lives of people in the Galar region.','Tworzy węgiel wewnątrz swojego ciała. Węgiel upuszczony przez tego Pokémona kiedyś pomagał zasilać życie ludzi w regionie Galar.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh2-106',0.06,0.02,'106'),('swsh2-107','Coalossal',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Fighting',839,'swsh2','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/107.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/107_hires.png','It\'s usually peaceful, but the vandalism of mines enrages it. Offenders will be incinerated with flames that reach 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit.','Zazwyczaj jest spokojnie, ale wandalizm w kopalniach doprowadza do wściekłości. Przestępcy zostaną spaleni płomieniami o temperaturze 2700 stopni Fahrenheita.','Grass',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh2-107',0.36,0.02,'107'),('swsh2-108','Sandaconda V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',220,'Fighting',844,'swsh2','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/108.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/108_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh2-108',1.14,0.5,'108'),('swsh2-109','Falinks',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',90,'Fighting',870,'swsh2','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/109.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh2/109_hires.png','Five of them are troopers, and one is the brass. The brass\'s orders are absolute.','Pięciu z nich to żołnierze, a jeden to szeregowy. Rozkazy szeregowych są absolutne.','Psychic',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh2-109',0.09,0.02,'109'),('swsh2-11','Masquerain',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1',