e nothing to eat. They\'re said to be on the verge of extinction.','Ścieki z fabryk są obecnie czyste, więc Grimerzy nie mają nic do jedzenia. Mówi się, że są na skraju wyginięcia.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-100',0.06,0.02,'100'),('swsh3-101','Muk',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',140,'Darkness',89,'swsh3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/101.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/101_hires.png','Because they scatter germs everywhere, they\'ve long been targeted for extermination, leading to a steep decline in their population.','Ponieważ rozsiewają zarazki wszędzie, od dawna są celem eksterminacji, co doprowadziło do gwałtownego spadku ich populacji.','Fighting',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-101',0.24,0.02,'101'),('swsh3-102','Spinarak',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Darkness',167,'swsh3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/102.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/102_hires.png','Although the poison from its fangs isn\'t that strong, it\'s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web.','Choć trucizna z jego kłów nie jest aż tak silna, jest wystarczająco silna, by osłabić ofiarę, która wpadnie w jego sieć.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-102',0.05,0.02,'102'),('swsh3-103','Ariados',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Darkness',168,'swsh3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/103.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/103_hires.png','It spews threads from its mouth to catch its prey. When night falls, it leaves its web to go hunt aggressively.','Wypluwa nici z pyska, aby złapać ofiarę. Gdy zapada noc, opuszcza sieć, aby agresywnie polować.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-103',0.1,0.02,'103'),('swsh3-104','Crobat V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',180,'Darkness',169,'swsh3','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/104.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/104_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-104',1,0.35,'104'),('swsh3-105','Darkrai',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Darkness',491,'swsh3','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/105.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/105_hires.png','It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.','Potrafi ukołysać ludzi do snu i sprawić, że będą śnić. Jest aktywny w noce nowiu.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-105',0.69,0.09,'105'),('swsh3-106','Purrloin',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Darkness',509,'swsh3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/106.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/106_hires.png','It steals things from people just to amuse itself with their frustration. A rivalry exists between this Pokémon and Nickit.','Kradnie ludziom rzeczy tylko po to, żeby zabawić się ich frustracją. Istnieje rywalizacja między tym Pokémonem a Nickitem.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-106',0.06,0.02,'106'),('swsh3-107','Liepard',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Darkness',510,'swsh3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/107.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/107_hires.png','Don\'t be fooled by its gorgeous fur and elegant figure. This is a moody and vicious Pokémon.','Nie daj się zwieść jego wspaniałemu futru i eleganckiej sylwetce. To kapryśny i okrutny Pokémon.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh3-107',0.17,0.02,'107'),('swsh3-108','Deino',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Darkness',633,'swsh3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/108.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh3/108_hires.png','When it encounters something, its first urge is usually to bite it. If it likes what it tastes, it will commit the associated scent to memory.','Kiedy coś napotyka, jego pierwszym odruchem jest zazwyczaj ugryzienie tego. Jeśli podoba mu się