ages.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/10_hires.png','If it remains still, it looks just like a real nut. It delights in surprising foraging Pokémon.','Jeśli pozostaje nieruchomy, wygląda jak prawdziwy orzech. Uwielbia zaskakiwać żerujące Pokémony.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-10',0.04,0.02,'10'),('swsh4-100','Clobbopus',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Fighting',852,'swsh4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/100.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/100_hires.png','It\'s very curious, but its means of investigating things is to try to punch them with its tentacles. The search for food is what brings it onto land.','To bardzo ciekawe, ale jego sposób badania rzeczy polega na próbie uderzania ich mackami. Poszukiwanie pożywienia sprowadza go na ląd.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-100',0.04,0.02,'100'),('swsh4-101','Grapploct',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Fighting',853,'swsh4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/101.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/101_hires.png','A body made up of nothing but muscle makes the grappling moves this Pokémon performs with its tentacles tremendously powerful.','Ciało zbudowane wyłącznie z mięśni sprawia, że ​​ruchy chwytne, które ten Pokémon wykonuje za pomocą macek, są niezwykle potężne.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-101',0.12,0.02,'101'),('swsh4-102','Zamazenta',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Fighting',889,'swsh4','Amazing Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/102.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/102_hires.png','Its ability to deflect any attack led to it being known as the Fighting Master\'s Shield. It was feared and respected by all.','Jego zdolność do odpierania ataków sprawiła, że ​​zaczęto go nazywać Tarczą Mistrza Walki. Wszyscy się go bali i szanowali.','Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-102',3.28,1.5,'102'),('swsh4-103','Poochyena',NULL,