a się para.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-23',0.07,0.02,'23'),('swsh4-24','Charmeleon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Fire',5,'swsh4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/24.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/24_hires.png','It has a barbaric nature. In battle, it whips its fiery tail around and slashes away with sharp claws.','Ma barbarzyńską naturę. W walce macha ognistym ogonem i tnie ostrymi pazurami.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-24',0.06,0.02,'24'),('swsh4-25','Charizard',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',170,'Fire',6,'swsh4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/25.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/25_hires.png','It spits fire that is hot enough to melt boulders. It may cause forest fires by blowing flames.','Pluje ogniem, który jest wystarczająco gorący, aby stopić głazy. Może powodować pożary lasów, zdmuchując płomienie.','Water',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-25',6.42,2.9,'25'),('swsh4-26','Flareon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Fire',136,'swsh4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/26.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/26_hires.png','Once it has stored up enough heat, this Pokémon\'s body temperature can reach up to 1,700 degrees Fahrenheit.','Gdy zgromadzi wystarczającą ilość ciepła, temperatura ciała tego Pokémona może osiągnąć nawet 1700 stopni Fahrenheita.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-26',0.59,0.02,'26'),('swsh4-27','Slugma',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Fire',218,'swsh4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/27.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/27_hires.png','Its body is made of magma. If it doesn\'t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.','Jego ciało składa się z magmy. Jeśli nie będzie się poruszać, jego ciało ostygnie i stwardnieje.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-27',0.05,0.02,'27'),('swsh4-28','Magcargo',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Fire',219,'swsh4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/28.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/28_hires.png','Its body is as hot as lava and is always billowing. Flames will occasionally burst from its shell.','Jego ciało jest gorące jak lawa i zawsze bucha. Z jego skorupy czasami wybuchają płomienie.','Water',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-28',0.05,0.02,'28'),('swsh4-29','Talonflame V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',190,'Fire',663,'swsh4','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/29.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/29_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Lightning',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-29',1.21,0.4,'29'),('swsh4-3','Beedrill',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',130,'Grass',15,'swsh4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/3.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/3_hires.png','May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.','Może pojawić się w roju. Lata z gwałtowną prędkością, cały czas kłując toksycznym żądłem z tyłu.','Fire',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-3',0.14,0.02,'3'),('swsh4-30','Vaporeon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',110,'Water',134,'swsh4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/30.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/30_hires.png','When Vaporeon\'s fins begin to vibrate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours.','Kiedy płetwy Vaporeona zaczynają wibrować, jest to znak, że w ciągu kilku godzin spadnie deszcz.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-30',0.51,0.02,'30'),('swsh4-31','Wailmer',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',100,'Water',320,'swsh4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/31.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/31_hires.png','It shows off by spraying jets of seawater from the nostrils above its eyes. It eats a solid ton of Wishiwashi every day.','Pokazuje się, tryskając strumieniami wody morskiej z nozdrzy nad oczami. Codziennie zjada solidną tonę Wishiwashi.','Lightning',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-31',0.05,0.02,'31'),('swsh4-32','Wailord',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',200,'Water',321,'swsh4','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/32.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/32_hires.png','It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.','Czasami może powalić przeciwników wstrząsem powstałym w wyniku przebicia się i rozbicia jego wielkiego ciała o wodę.','Lightning',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-32',0.47,0.02,'32'),('swsh4-33','Oshawott',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',501,'swsh4','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/33.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/33_hires.png','It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing.','Walczy, używając muszli na brzuchu. W odpowiedzi na atak natychmiast odpowiada cięciem.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-33',0.04,0.02,'33'),('swsh4-34','Dewott',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',502,'swsh4','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/34.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/34_hires.png','As a result of strict training, each Dewott learns different forms for using the scalchops.','W wyniku rygorystycznego treningu każdy Dewott uczy się różnych form korzystania z muszli.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh4-34',0.06,0.02,'34'),('swsh4-35','Samurott',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Water',503,'swsh4','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/35.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh4/35_hires.png','One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody.','Jeden zamach mieczem wkomponowanym w