45sv-SV014','Appletun',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Grass',842,'swsh45sv','Rare Shiny','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV014.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV014_hires.png','Eating a sweet apple caused its evolution. A nectarous scent wafts from its body, luring in the bug Pokémon it preys on.','Zjedzenie słodkiego jabłka spowodowało jego ewolucję. Z jego ciała unosi się nektarowy zapach, wabiąc robaczego Pokémona, na którego poluje.','Fire',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh45sv-SV014',3.09,1.6,'SV014'),('swsh45sv-SV015','Scorbunny',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fire',813,'swsh45sv','Rare Shiny','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV015.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV015_hires.png','It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it\'s raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.','Ma specjalne poduszki na tylnej stronie łap i jedną na nosie. Gdy jest gotowy do walki, poduszki te wydzielają ogromne ciepło.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh45sv-SV015',1.68,0.8,'SV015'),('swsh45sv-SV016','Raboot',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Fire',814,'swsh45sv','Rare Shiny','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV016.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV016_hires.png','It kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork.','Skopuje jagody prosto z gałęzi drzew, a następnie żongluje nimi nogami, ćwicząc pracę nóg.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh45sv-SV016',3.78,2.8,'SV016'),('swsh45sv-SV017','Cinderace',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',170,'Fire',815,'swsh45sv','Rare Shiny','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV017.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh45sv/SV017_hires.png','It\'s skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.','Jest u