/swsh5/4_hires.png','It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body.','Preferuje surowe środowiska, takie jak pustynie. Może przetrwać 30 dni na wodzie zgromadzonej w swoim ciele.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-4',0.04,0.02,'4'),('swsh5-40','Empoleon V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V,Rapid Strike','Basic',210,'Water',395,'swsh5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/40.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/40_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-40',1.06,0.25,'40'),('swsh5-41','Frillish',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Water',592,'swsh5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/41.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/41_hires.png','Legend has it that the residents of a sunken ancient city changed into these Pokémon.','Legenda głosi, że mieszkańcy zatopionego starożytnego miasta zmienili się w te Pokémony.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-41',0.05,0.02,'41'),('swsh5-42','Jellicent',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Water',593,'swsh5','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/42.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/42_hires.png','Whenever a full moon hangs in the night sky, schools of Jellicent gather near the surface of the sea, waiting for their prey to appear.','Kiedykolwiek pełnia księżyca wisi na nocnym niebie, ławice Jellicentów zbierają się w pobliżu powierzchni morza, czekając na pojawienie się swojej ofiary.','Lightning',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-42',0.21,0.02,'42'),('swsh5-43','Bruxish',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',110,'Water',779,'swsh5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/43.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/43_hires.png','Its skin is thick enough to fend off Mareanie\'s spikes. With its robust teeth, Bruxish crunches up the spikes and eats them.','Jego skóra jest wystarczająco gruba, by odepr