rp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.','Silny prąd przepływa przez końcówki jego ostrych pazurów. Lekkie zadrapanie powoduje omdlenie u wrogów.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-47',0.04,0.02,'47'),('swsh5-48','Luxray',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2,Rapid Strike','Stage 2',150,'Lightning',405,'swsh5','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/48.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/48_hires.png','Luxray\'s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it\'s scouting for danger.','Umiejętność Luxraya widzenia przez przedmioty przydaje się, gdy wypatruje niebezpieczeństwa.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-48',0.24,0.02,'48'),('swsh5-49','Pachirisu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',417,'swsh5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/49.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/49_hires.png','A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.','Można zobaczyć parę, która pociera o siebie policzki, próbując podzielić się zgromadzoną energią elektryczną.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-49',0.05,0.02,'49'),('swsh5-5','Cacturne',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Grass',332,'swsh5','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/5.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/5_hires.png','Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move.','Stada ich podążają za podróżnikami przez pustynię, dopóki podróżni nie będą mogli się ruszyć.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-5',0.06,0.02,'5'),('swsh5-50','Tapu Koko V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',210,'Lightning',785,'swsh5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/50.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/50_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-50',1,0.2,'50'),('swsh5-51','Tapu Koko VMAX',NULL,'Pokém