oats on winds to travel great distances.','Emitując ultradźwiękowe krzyki, unosi się na wietrze, pokonując duże odległości.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-59',0.04,0.02,'59'),('swsh5-6','Kricketune V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',180,'Grass',402,'swsh5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/6.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/6_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-6',0.93,0.35,'6'),('swsh5-60','Espurr',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Psychic',677,'swsh5','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/60_hires.png','There\'s enough psychic power in Espurr to send a wrestler flying, but because this power can\'t be controlled, Espurr finds it troublesome.','Espurr ma wystarczająco dużo mocy psychicznej, aby wysłać zapaśnika w powietrze, ale ponieważ tej mocy nie można kontrolować, Espurr uważa ją za kłopotliwą.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-60',0.05,0.02,'60'),('swsh5-61','Meowstic',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',678,'swsh5','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/61_hires.png','The defensive instinct of the males is strong. It\'s when they\'re protecting themselves or their partners that they unleash their full power.','Instynkt obronny samców jest silny. To właśnie wtedy, gdy chronią siebie lub swoje partnerki, uwalniają całą swoją moc.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-61',0.48,0.05,'61'),('swsh5-62','Mimikyu V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',160,'Psychic',778,'swsh5','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/62.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh5/62_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh5-62',1.14,0.4,'62'),('swsh5-63','Necrozma V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',220,'Psychic',800,'swsh5','Rare Holo