ause it can\'t see, this Pokémon is constantly biting at everything it touches, trying to keep track of its surroundings.','Ponieważ nie widzi, ten Pokémon nieustannie gryzie wszystko, czego dotknie, próbując śledzić swoje otoczenie.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-113',0.03,0.02,'113'),('swsh7-114','Zweilous',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Dragon',634,'swsh7','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/114.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/114_hires.png','Their two heads will fight each other over a single piece of food. Zweilous are covered in scars even without battling others.','Ich dwie głowy będą walczyć ze sobą o jeden kawałek jedzenia. Zweilous są pokryte bliznami nawet bez walki z innymi.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-114',0.04,0.02,'114'),('swsh7-115','Hydreigon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',170,'Dragon',635,'swsh7','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/115.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/115_hires.png','The three heads take turns sinking their teeth into the opponent. Their attacks won\'t slow until their target goes down.','Trzy głowy na zmianę wbijają zęby w przeciwnika. Ich ataki nie zwolnią, dopóki cel nie padnie.',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-115',0.26,0.02,'115'),('swsh7-116','Kyurem',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Dragon',646,'swsh7','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/116.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/116_hires.png','It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.','Generuje potężną, mroźną energię wewnątrz siebie, ale jego ciało zamarzło, gdy energia wyciekła.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-116',0.24,0.02,'116'),('swsh7-117','Noivern V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',200,'Dragon',715,'swsh7','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/117.png','https://images.pokemontcg.i