es.png','With its sturdy jaws and fangs, it can easily chomp wooden boats to splinters. It fights with Basculin over food.','Dzięki swoim mocnym szczękom i kłom może z łatwością rozłupywać drewniane łodzie na drzazgi. Walczy z Basculinem o jedzenie.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-35',0.03,0.02,'35'),('swsh7-36','Sharpedo',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Water',319,'swsh7','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/36.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/36_hires.png','It drinks in seawater and jets it from its rear to propel itself. It\'s very sensitive to the scent of blood.','Pije wodę morską i wyrzuca ją z tyłu, aby się poruszać. Jest bardzo wrażliwy na zapach krwi.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-36',0.07,0.02,'36'),('swsh7-37','Feebas',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Rapid Strike','Basic',30,'Water',349,'swsh7','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/37.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/37_hires.png','It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.','To obskurny i brzydki Pokémon. Jest jednak bardzo wytrzymały i może przetrwać przy małej ilości wody.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-37',0.03,0.02,'37'),('swsh7-38','Milotic',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,Rapid Strike','Stage 1',120,'Water',350,'swsh7','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/38.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/38_hires.png','It\'s said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you\'re feeling.','Mówi się, że spojrzenie na Milotica i jego piękno ukoi wszelkie wrogie emocje, które odczuwasz.','Lightning',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-38',0.06,0.02,'38'),('swsh7-39','Luvdisc',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',370,'swsh7','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/39.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/39_hires.png','Luvdisc makes its home in cor