okemontcg.io/swsh7/62_hires.png','There are some Hypno that assist doctors with patients who can\'t sleep at night in hospitals.','Istnieją pewne metody hipnozy, które pomagają lekarzom w pracy z pacjentami, którzy nie mogą spać w nocy w szpitalach.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-62',0.03,0.02,'62'),('swsh7-63','Galarian Articuno',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',120,'Psychic',144,'swsh7','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/63.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/63_hires.png','Known as Articuno, this Pokémon fires beams that can immobilize opponents as if they had been frozen solid.','Znany jako Articuno, ten Pokémon wystrzeliwuje wiązki, które mogą unieruchomić przeciwników, jakby zostali zamrożeni.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-63',0.26,0.02,'63'),('swsh7-64','Espeon V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',200,'Psychic',196,'swsh7','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/64.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/64_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-64',1.91,1.21,'64'),('swsh7-65','Espeon VMAX',NULL,'Pokémon','VMAX','VMAX',310,'Psychic',196,'swsh7','Rare Holo VMAX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/65.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/65_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-65',8.42,3,'65'),('swsh7-66','Wobbuffet',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Single Strike','Basic',120,'Psychic',202,'swsh7','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/66.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh7/66_hires.png','To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack.','Aby ukryć swój czarny jak smoła ogon, żyje cicho w ciemności. Nigdy nie atakuje jako pierwszy.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh7-66',0.04,0.02,'66'),('swsh7-67','Sableye',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',302,'swsh7',