les up on the ground. The more snow it eats, the bigger and more impressive the spikes on its back grow.','Je śnieg, który gromadzi się na ziemi. Im więcej śniegu zje, tym większe i bardziej imponujące stają się kolce na jego grzbiecie.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh8-84',0.03,0.02,'84'),('swsh8-85','Frosmoth',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',873,'swsh8','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/85.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/85_hires.png','It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.','Nie okazuje litości tym, którzy bezczeszczą pola i góry. Będzie latać na swoich lodowatych skrzydłach, wywołując zamieć, która odstraszy przestępców.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh8-85',0.05,0.02,'85'),('swsh8-86','Pikachu V',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,V','Basic',200,'Lightning',25,'swsh8','Rare Holo V','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/86.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/86_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh8-86',1.74,0.85,'86'),('swsh8-87','Voltorb',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,Single Strike','Basic',60,'Lightning',100,'swsh8','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/87.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/87_hires.png','Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a Poké Ball, it has zapped many people.','Zwykle spotykany w elektrowniach. Łatwo pomylony z Poké Ballem, poraziło wiele osób.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh8-87',0.04,0.02,'87'),('swsh8-88','Electrode',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1,Single Strike','Stage 1',90,'Lightning',101,'swsh8','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/88.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh8/88_hires.png','It stores an overflowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode.','Ma w swoim ciele przepełnioną ilość en