okemontcg.io/swsh9/117.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/117_hires.png','They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying.','Gromadzą się wokół gór i pól, goniąc za Pokémonami-robakami. Ich śpiew jest głośny i irytujący.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-117',0.02,0.02,'117'),('swsh9-118','Staravia',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Colorless',397,'swsh9','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/118.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/118_hires.png','It lives in forests and fields. Squabbles over territory occur when flocks collide.','Żyje w lasach i na polach. Kłótnie o terytorium zdarzają się, gdy stada się zderzają.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-118',0.03,0.02,'118'),('swsh9-119','Staraptor',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',150,'Colorless',398,'swsh9','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/119.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/119_hires.png','When Staravia evolve into Staraptor, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings.','Kiedy Staravia ewoluuje w Staraptora, opuszcza stado, aby żyć samotnie. Mają mocne skrzydła.','Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-119',0.09,0.02,'119'),('swsh9-12','Cherubi',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',40,'Grass',420,'swsh9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/12.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/12_hires.png','The deeper a Cherubi\'s red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!','Im głębsza czerwień Cherubina, tym więcej składników odżywczych zgromadził w swoim ciele. I tym słodsza i smaczniejsza jest jego mała kulka!','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-12',0.03,0.02,'12'),('swsh9-120','Bidoof',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Colorless',399,'swsh9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/120.png','https://images.pok