Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/6.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/6_hires.png','It undertakes photosynthesis with its body, making oxygen. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty.','Przeprowadza fotosyntezę swoim ciałem, wytwarzając tlen. Liść na jego głowie więdnie, gdy jest spragniony.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-6',0.04,0.02,'6'),('swsh9-60','Duskull',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Psychic',355,'swsh9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/60.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/60_hires.png','If it finds bad children who won\'t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away—or so it\'s said.','Jeśli znajdzie złe dzieci, które nie będą słuchać swoich rodziców, porywa je — tak przynajmniej się mówi.','Darkness',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-60',0.02,0.02,'60'),('swsh9-61','Dusclops',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Psychic',356,'swsh9','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/61.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/61_hires.png','Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.','Jego ciało jest całkowicie puste. Kiedy otwiera usta, wsysa wszystko, jakby było czarną dziurą.','Darkness',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-61',0.03,0.02,'61'),('swsh9-62','Dusknoir',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',160,'Psychic',477,'swsh9','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/62.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh9/62_hires.png','At the bidding of transmissions from the spirit world, it steals people and Pokémon away. No one knows whether it has a will of its own.','Na rozkaz transmisji ze świata duchów kradnie ludzi i Pokémony. Nikt nie wie, czy ma własną wolę.','Darkness',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/swsh9-62',0.11,0.02,'62'),('swsh9-63','Chimecho',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Psychic',358,'swsh9','Common','https://images.pokemontcg