s and mountains, spring is on the way.','Unosi się na wietrze. Mówi się, że gdy Hoppip zbierają się na polach i w górach, wiosna jest w drodze.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy11-3',0.07,0.02,'3'),('xy11-30','Oshawott',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',501,'xy11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/30.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/30_hires.png','It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing.','Walczy, używając muszli na brzuchu. W odpowiedzi na atak natychmiast odpowiada cięciem.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy11-30',0.07,0.02,'30'),('xy11-31','Dewott',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',502,'xy11','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/31.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/31_hires.png','As a result of strict training, each Dewott learns different forms for using the scalchops.','W wyniku rygorystycznego treningu każdy Dewott uczy się różnych form korzystania z muszli.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy11-31',0.07,0.02,'31'),('xy11-32','Samurott',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',140,'Water',503,'xy11','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/32.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/32_hires.png','One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody.','Jeden zamach mieczem wkomponowanym w zbroję może powalić przeciwnika. Proste spojrzenie jednego z nich ucisza wszystkich.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy11-32',0.37,0.02,'32'),('xy11-33','Clauncher',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',692,'xy11','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/33.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy11/33_hires.png','Through controlled expulsions of internal gas, it can expel water like a pistol shot. At close distances, it can shatter rock.','Dzięki kontrolowanemu wydalaniu wewn