69,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/1.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/1_hires.png','Even though its body is extremely skinny, it is blindingly fast when catching its prey.','Mimo że jego ciało jest niezwykle chude, jest on niewiarygodnie szybki, gdy łapie swoją ofiarę.','Fire',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-1',0.15,0.02,'1'),('xy3-10','Magmar',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Fire',126,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/10.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/10_hires.png','Found near the mouth of a volcano. This fire-breather\'s body temperature is nearly 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit.','Znaleziono w pobliżu ujścia wulkanu. Temperatura ciała tego ziejącego ogniem stworzenia wynosi prawie 2200 stopni Fahrenheita.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-10',0.09,0.02,'10'),('xy3-100','Super Scoop Up',NULL,'Trainer','Item','Item',NULL,NULL,NULL,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/100.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/100_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-100',0.15,0.02,'100'),('xy3-101','Tool Retriever',NULL,'Trainer','Item','Item',NULL,NULL,NULL,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/101.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/101_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-101',0.12,0.02,'101'),('xy3-102','Training Center',NULL,'Trainer','Stadium','Stadium',NULL,NULL,NULL,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/102.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/102_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-102',0.14,0.05,'102'),('xy3-103','Herbal Energy',NULL,'Energy','Special','Special',NULL,NULL,NULL,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/103.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/103_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-103',0.45,0.02,'103'),('xy3-