e ognia o temperaturze ponad 3600 stopni Fahrenheita z końców ramion. Żyje w kraterach wulkanicznych.','Water',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-11',0.6,0.03,'11'),('xy3-110','Fossil Researcher',NULL,'Trainer','Supporter','Supporter',NULL,NULL,NULL,'xy3','Rare Ultra','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/110.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/110_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-110',17.31,4.99,'110'),('xy3-111','Korrina',NULL,'Trainer','Supporter','Supporter',NULL,NULL,NULL,'xy3','Rare Ultra','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/111.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/111_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-111',22.5,5.5,'111'),('xy3-112','M Heracross-EX',NULL,'Pokémon','MEGA,EX','MEGA',220,'Grass',214,'xy3','Rare Secret','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/112.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/112_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Fire',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-112',24.48,9.05,'112'),('xy3-113','M Lucario-EX',NULL,'Pokémon','MEGA,EX','MEGA',220,'Fighting',448,'xy3','Rare Secret','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/113.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/113_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Psychic',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-113',42.81,32,'113');
INSERT INTO `tcg_card` VALUES ('xy3-12','Torchic',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Fire',255,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/12.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/12_hires.png','It has a flame sac inside its belly that perpetually burns. It feels warm if it is hugged.','Ma w brzuchu worek z płomieniami, który ciągle pali. Czuje ciepło, gdy się go przytula.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-12',0.12,0.02,'12'),('xy3-13','Combusken',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Fire',256,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/13.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/13_hires.png','Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.','Jego mistrzostwo kopania pozwala mu na wykonywanie 10 kopnięć na sekundę. Wydaje ostre okrzyki, aby zastraszyć wrogów.','Water',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-13',0.19,0.04,'13'),('xy3-14','Blaziken',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',140,'Fire',257,'xy3','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/14.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/14_hires.png','It can clear a 30-story building in a leap. Its fiery punches scorch its foes.','Może przeskoczyć 30-piętrowy budynek jednym skokiem. Jego ogniste ciosy przypalają wrogów.','Water',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-14',37.33,6,'14'),('xy3-15','Poliwag',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',60,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/15.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/15_hires.png','Its slick black skin is thin and damp. A part of its internal organs can be seen through the skin as a spiral pattern.','Jego śliska, czarna skóra jest cienka i wilgotna. Część jego organów wewnętrznych można zobaczyć przez skórę jako spiralny wzór.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-15',0.14,0.02,'15'),('xy3-16','Poliwhirl',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Water',61,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/16.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/16_hires.png','It can live in or out of water. When out of water, it constantly sweats to keep its body slimy.','Może żyć w wodzie lub poza nią. Kiedy jest poza wodą, stale się poci, aby utrzymać śluzowate ciało.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-16',0.18,0.03,'16'),('xy3-17','Poliwrath',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',140,'Water',62,'xy3','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/17.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/17_hires.png','With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.','Dzięki niezwykle mocnym mięśniom może pływać w Oceanie Spokojnym bez odpoczynku.','Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-17',1.43,0.3,'17'),('xy3-18','Politoed',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',130,'Water',186,'xy3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/18.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/18_hires.png','Whenever three or more of these get together, they sing in a loud voice that sounds like bellowing.','Kiedykolwiek trzy lub więcej z nich się spotka, śpiewają głośnym głosem, który brzmi jak ryk.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-18',0.53,0.15,'18'),('xy3-19','Glaceon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Water',471,'xy3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/19.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/19_hires.png','By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry.','Kontrolując ciepło swojego ciała, może zamrozić atmosferę wokół siebie, tworząc chmurę pyłu diamentowego.','Metal',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-19',3.15,0.5,'19'),('xy3-2','Weepinbell',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',80,'Grass',70,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/2.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/2_hires.png','The leafy parts act as cutters for slashing foes. It spits a fluid that dissolves everything.','Liściaste części działają jak noże tnące do cięcia wrogów. Wypluwa płyn, który rozpuszcza wszystko.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-2',0.16,0.02,'2'),('xy3-20','Seismitoad-EX',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,EX','Basic',180,'Water',537,'xy3','Rare Holo EX','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/20.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/20_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Grass',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-20',3.16,1,'20'),('xy3-21','Cubchoo',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Water',613,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/21.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/21_hires.png','Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up because the mucus provides the raw material for its moves.','Z nosa ciągle mu cieknie. Wciąga katar z powrotem, ponieważ śluz dostarcza mu surowca do ruchów.','Metal',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-21',0.06,0.02,'21'),('xy3-22','Beartic',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Water',614,'xy3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/22.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/22_hires.png','They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath.','Uwielbiają zimne morza północy. Tworzą ścieżki przez wody oceanów, zamrażając własny oddech.','Metal',NULL,4,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-22',0.49,0.05,'22'),('xy3-23','Clauncher',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Water',692,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/23.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/23_hires.png','They knock down flying prey by firing compressed water from their massive claws like shooting a pistol.','Powalają latającą zdobycz, wystrzeliwując sprężoną wodę ze swoich potężnych pazurów, niczym strzelając z pistoletu.','Grass',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-23',0.07,0.02,'23'),('xy3-24','Clawitzer',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Water',693,'xy3','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/24.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/24_hires.png','Their enormous claws launch cannonballs of water powerful enough to pierce tanker hulls.','Ich ogromne szpony wystrzeliwują kule armatnie z wodą na tyle silne, że są w stanie przebić kadłuby tankowców.','Grass',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-24',0.77,0.25,'24'),('xy3-25','Amaura',NULL,'Pokémon','Restored','Restored',90,'Water',698,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/25.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/25_hires.png','This ancient Pokémon was restored from part of its body that had been frozen in ice for over 100 million years.','Ten starożytny Pokémon został odtworzony z części jego ciała, która była zamrożona w lodzie przez ponad 100 milionów lat.','Metal',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-25',0.6,0.02,'25'),('xy3-26','Aurorus',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',130,'Water',699,'xy3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/26.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/26_hires.png','The diamond-shaped crystals on its body expel air as cold as -240 degrees Fahrenheit, surrounding its enemies and encasing them in ice.','Kryształy w kształcie diamentów na jego ciele wypuszczają powietrze o temperaturze -240 stopni Fahrenheita, otaczając wrogów i zamykając ich w lodzie.','Metal',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-26',11.81,8,'26'),('xy3-27','Pikachu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Lightning',25,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/27.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/27_hires.png','It raises its tail to check its surroundings. The tail is sometimes struck by lightning in this pose.','Podnosi ogon, aby sprawdzić otoczenie. W tej pozie ogon jest czasami uderzany piorunem.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-27',2.31,0.08,'27'),('xy3-28','Raichu',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',90,'Lightning',26,'xy3','Uncommon','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/28.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/28_hires.png','When its electricity builds, its muscles are stimulated, and it becomes more aggressive than usual.','Kiedy jego elektryczność wzrasta, jego mięśnie są stymulowane i staje się bardziej agresywny niż zwykle.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-28',1.03,0.1,'28'),('xy3-29','Electabuzz',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',80,'Lightning',125,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/29.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/29_hires.png','Electricity runs across the surface of its body. In darkness, its body glows a whitish blue.','Elektryczność przepływa przez powierzchnię jego ciała. W ciemności jego ciało świeci na biało-niebiesko.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-29',0.16,0.02,'29'),('xy3-3','Victreebel',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 2','Stage 2',130,'Grass',71,'xy3','Rare Holo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/3.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/3_hires.png','Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there.','Mówi się, że mieszkają w ogromnych koloniach głęboko w dżungli, choć nikt nigdy stamtąd nie powrócił.','Fire',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-3',0.71,0.1,'3'),('xy3-30','Electivire',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',120,'Lightning',466,'xy3','Rare','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/30.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/30_hires.png','As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns.','W miarę jak jego ładunek elektryczny się wzmacnia, między jego rogami zaczynają trzaskać niebieskie iskry.','Fighting',NULL,3,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xy3-30',0.77,0.1,'30'),('xy3-31','Plusle',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',70,'Lightning',311,'xy3','Common','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/31.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xy3/31_hires.png','It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.','Kibicuje przyjacio