Y94',4.79,1.99,'XY94'),('xyp-XY95','Pikachu',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic','Basic',60,'Lightning',25,'xyp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY95.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY95_hires.png','It has small electric sacs on both its cheeks. If threatened, it looses electric charges from the sacs.','Ma małe worki elektryczne na obu policzkach. W razie zagrożenia uwalnia ładunki elektryczne z worków.','Fighting',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xyp-XY95',43.74,16,'XY95'),('xyp-XY96','Umbreon',NULL,'Pokémon','Stage 1','Stage 1',100,'Darkness',197,'xyp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY96.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY96_hires.png','When exposed to the moon\'s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it\'s filled with a mysterious power.','Gdy księżyc zostanie wystawiony na działanie aury, pierścienie na jego ciele zaczynają słabo świecić, a on sam jest wypełniony tajemniczą mocą.','Fighting',NULL,2,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xyp-XY96',21.36,5,'XY96'),('xyp-XY97','Aerodactyl-EX',NULL,'Pokémon','Basic,EX','Basic',170,'Fighting',142,'xyp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY97.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY97_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xyp-XY97',6.25,3.4,'XY97'),('xyp-XY98','M Aerodactyl-EX',NULL,'Pokémon','MEGA,EX','MEGA',210,'Fighting',142,'xyp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY98.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY98_hires.png',NULL,NULL,'Lightning',NULL,1,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xyp-XY98',17.48,5,'XY98'),('xyp-XY99','Aerodactyl Spirit Link',NULL,'Trainer','Pokémon Tool','Pokémon Tool',NULL,NULL,NULL,'xyp','Promo','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY99.png','https://images.pokemontcg.io/xyp/XY99_hires.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://prices.pokemontcg.io/cardmarket/xyp-XY99',2.71,2.5,'XY99');
